                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I also think the challenge needs to be manageable, because too much pressure can do more harm than good.",
                  "textZh": "不過,我也認為挑戰必須是可承受的,因為壓力如果過大,往往會弊多於利。",
