                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "There is a big difference between being stretched and being crushed. If people are challenged in a healthy way, they are likely to develop confidence and problem-solving skills. But if the pressure is constant, overwhelming, or unrealistic, it can drain their energy and damage their mental health. To me, challenge is a bit like exercise: the right amount makes you stronger, but too much can leave you injured.",
