                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "In a team setting, people are meant to combine their strengths, support one another, and pull in the same direction. If everyone is too focused on personal growth alone, the team can easily lose sight of the bigger picture. After all, a team is not just a collection of talented individuals; it is more like a machine in which every part needs to work together smoothly. If people only chase personal progress, the group may end up dropping the ball when it matters most.",
