                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, individual development still matters a great deal, because strong teams are built on strong individuals.",
                  "textZh": "不過，個人發展仍然非常重要，因為強大的團隊，始終是由強大而有能力的個體所組成的。",
