                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "If team members are not growing, learning, or sharpening their skills, the team may hit a ceiling sooner or later. In other words, team success cannot rest on teamwork alone; it also depends on whether each person is becoming more capable over time. Personal development is like the fuel in the engine: it may not be the final destination, but without it, the team will struggle to go far.",
