                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, in a sports team, players need to improve their stamina, technique, and decision-making as individuals. If every player raises their game, the team is much more likely to perform like a well-oiled machine instead of a group of people merely sharing the same uniform.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在一支運動隊伍裡，球員需要以個人身份提升自己的體能、技術和判斷力。如果每位球員都能提升自己的水平，整個團隊就更有可能像一部運作流暢的機器，而不只是一些穿著同樣制服的人。",
