                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in a group project at school or at work, if two members keep disagreeing over every decision and refuse to meet each other halfway, the rest of the team may get caught in the crossfire. As a result, progress slows down, frustration builds up, and the final result is likely to suffer.",
