                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think disagreement is always a bad thing, because when it is managed well, it can actually strengthen teamwork rather than weaken it.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我並不認為分歧一定是壞事，因為如果處理得好，它其實能夠強化團隊合作，而不是削弱它。",
