                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "In fact, some disagreement can be healthy, because it shows that people are thinking independently instead of simply going along with the crowd. When team members challenge ideas respectfully, they can spot weaknesses, improve decisions, and avoid blind spots. In other words, a certain amount of friction can sharpen the team rather than tear it apart. It is a bit like fire: in the right place it provides warmth and light, but out of control it can burn everything down.",
