                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, children can be taught from a young age to respect nature, while adults can support wildlife charities, avoid buying animal-based luxury goods, and choose more sustainable lifestyles. Bit by bit, those choices can add up, because conservation is not only the government’s job; it is everyone’s responsibility.",
                  "textZh": "例如，孩子可以從小被教導去尊重自然，而成年人則可以支持野生動物保育機構、拒絕購買以動物製成的奢侈品，並且選擇更可持續的生活方式。這些選擇看似微小，但慢慢累積起來卻能產生影響，因為保育不只是政府的責任，而是每一個人的責任。",
