                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I take a balanced view: animal research may be acceptable as a last resort in vital medical research, but beyond that, I do not think it is a good idea.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我的看法比較平衡：如果是在關鍵性的醫學研究中，而且已經到了最後手段，那麼動物研究或許可以被接受；但除此之外，我並不認為這是一個好主意。",
