                  "textEn": "The main reason is that people are surrounded by text almost all the time. They read messages, emails, news headlines, social media posts, captions, comments, and online articles from morning to night. In that sense, modern life is awash with words. Even when people are not sitting down with a novel, they are still reading in bits and pieces throughout the day. So, if we look at reading as a whole, it is hard to deny that people are constantly taking in written information.",
