                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a small café may begin by serving excellent coffee, offering warm service, and building a loyal base of regular customers. Once it earns a good name in the local area, it can gradually open a second branch or expand into delivery and branded products. In that case, growth happens brick by brick rather than all at once.",
