                  "textEn": "Even a strong business cannot grow if everything depends on one person doing all the heavy lifting. At some point, the owner has to delegate, build systems, manage money carefully, and adapt to changes in the market. Social media, branding, customer feedback, and efficient operations all play an important role here. To be honest, growth is not just about working harder; it is about working smarter. A business that bites off more than it can chew may grow quickly on paper, but it can also come crashing down just as fast.",
