                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "In my opinion, one of the most important skills is the ability to understand customers and manage the practical side of the business well.",
                  "textZh": "依我看，其中一項最重要的技能，就是懂得了解顧客，並且把生意的實際運作管理好。",
