                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another skill that matters a great deal is resilience, along with the ability to adapt and make decisions under pressure.",
                  "textZh": "另一項非常重要的能力，就是抗壓和韌性，以及在壓力之下適應變化和作出決定的能力。",
