                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one clear impact of globalisation is that it gives businesses more room to expand, compete, and reach people far beyond their home market.",
                  "textZh": "所以，全球化其中一個很明顯的影響，就是它讓企業有更多空間去擴張、競爭，並接觸遠遠超出本地市場的人。",
                  "pages": [
                    75
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    75,
                    75
                  ]
