                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say a company leader needs a mixture of clear judgement, strong communication, emotional intelligence, and integrity. Titles may open the door, but it is these qualities that allow someone to lead people well and keep the business on course.",
                  "textZh": "[總結來說，我會說一位公司領袖需要結合清晰的判斷力、良好的溝通能力、情商，以及誠信。職銜也許可以打開一扇門，但真正能讓一個人把團隊帶好、讓企業保持方向的，始終是這些特質。",
