                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, in general, I do think change is good, because it helps people grow, adapt, and avoid becoming stuck in old patterns.",
                  "textZh": "是的，整體來說，我的確認為改變是好事，因為它能幫助人們成長、適應，並避免自己一直困在舊有模式之中。",
