                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think one of the biggest changes people go through is a change in their roles and responsibilities.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，人一生中其中一個最大的改變，就是身份角色和責任上的轉變。",
