                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one major life change is that people gradually take on new roles and greater responsibility as they grow older.",
                  "textZh": "所以，人生其中一個重大改變，就是人會隨著年齡增長，逐漸承擔新的角色和更大的責任。",
