                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, many people in large cities have to spend a long time commuting on overcrowded trains, only to go home to a tiny flat that costs a fortune. If that happens day in, day out, it is no surprise that people start to feel stressed and drained.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在大城市裡，很多人每天都要花很長時間擠在爆滿的列車上通勤，回到家後卻只是住進一個面積很小、但租金或樓價高得驚人的單位。如果這樣的生活日復一日地持續下去，人們會開始感到壓力沉重、身心俱疲，其實一點也不令人意外。",
