                  "number": 1,
                  "sourceNumber": 1,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think the most effective way is to invest in better urban planning and stronger public services, because crowded cities become much harder to live in when basic systems are stretched to the limit.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，最有效的方法是投放資源於更好的城市規劃和更完善的公共服務，因為當一座擠迫的城市連基本系統都被拉扯到極限時，生活自然會變得困難得多。",
