                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a government builds affordable flats near transport hubs, expands train lines, and opens more local clinics and schools, people can save both time and energy. Instead of spending hours commuting or waiting for services, they can have a more manageable and less exhausting daily routine.",
