                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, to me, improving living standards in crowded cities starts with getting the basics right, because when housing, transport, and public services run smoothly, the whole city breathes more easily.",
