                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, governments should make crowded cities more humane by creating cleaner, greener, and safer living environments.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，政府也應該令擠迫的城市變得更有人味，方法就是打造更清潔、更綠化、也更安全的生活環境。",
