                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if the government turns unused land into small parks, adds more cycling paths, improves street lighting, and sets stricter air-quality standards, residents may feel the difference almost immediately. Families would have somewhere to relax, children could play more safely, and older people might find the neighbourhood far more pleasant to live in.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果政府把閒置土地改造成小型公園、增設單車徑、改善街道照明，並訂立更嚴格的空氣質素標準，居民往往很快就能感受到分別。家庭會有地方放鬆，小朋友可以更安全地玩耍，而長者也可能會覺得整個社區明顯更適合居住。",
