                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think one of the most effective things people can do is reduce their reliance on private cars and use cleaner forms of transport instead.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，人們其中一個最有效可以做的事情，就是減少依賴私家車，改用較潔淨的交通方式。",
