                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if office workers choose the train or bus instead of driving alone every day, the overall number of cars on the road can fall quite noticeably. Even small changes, such as walking to nearby shops rather than driving there, can add up over time.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果上班族每天選擇搭地鐵或巴士，而不是自己一個人開車上班，路上的車輛總數就可能明顯下降。即使只是一些小改變，例如去附近的商店時改為步行而不是開車，長久下來也會累積出效果。",
