                  "textEn": "So, from my point of view, changing the way people travel is one of the clearest and most practical ways to improve air quality in a city.",
                  "textZh": "所以，在我看來，改變人們的出行方式，是改善城市空氣質素最直接、也最實際的方法之一。",
