                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, people can help by living in a more environmentally responsible way in their daily lives.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，人們也可以透過在日常生活中活得更有環保意識，去幫助改善空氣質素。",
                  "pages": [
                    15
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    15,
                    15
                  ]
