                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a quiet farming area suddenly had several tall towers built in the middle of it, the buildings might block the landscape, change the atmosphere, and even place extra pressure on local roads and services. In that situation, building higher would not necessarily mean living better.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個安靜的農村地區突然在中央建起幾幢高塔，那些建築物可能會遮擋風景、改變整體氣氛，甚至為當地道路和公共服務帶來額外壓力。在那種情況下，建得更高並不一定代表住得更好。",
