                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in a crowded city centre, high-rise residential blocks may be extremely useful because they allow thousands of people to live near jobs, transport links, and daily services. Without that kind of vertical development, the city might sprawl endlessly or push housing even further out of reach.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在擠迫的市中心，高層住宅大樓可能非常有用，因為它們能讓成千上萬的人住在工作地點、交通網絡，以及日常服務附近。若沒有這種向上發展的方式，城市可能會無止境地向外擴張，或者令住屋變得更加難以負擔。",
