                  "textEn": "For instance, a low-rise neighbourhood with small shops, schools, parks, and mid-rise housing may feel far more welcoming than an area dominated by huge towers. People may be more likely to walk, interact with neighbours, and feel attached to the place where they live.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個有小商店、學校、公園，以及中低層住宅的社區，往往會比一個被巨大高樓主導的地區更令人感到親切。在那樣的環境中，人們可能更願意步行、更容易和鄰里互動，也更容易對自己居住的地方產生歸屬感。",
