                  "textEn": "For example, people often enjoy going to night markets, festivals, concerts, or busy shopping streets, because those places are humming with life. Even if they do not buy very much or stay very long, they may still enjoy soaking up the atmosphere and feeling part of something bigger than themselves.",
                  "textZh": "例如，人們往往喜歡去夜市、節慶活動、演唱會，或者繁忙的購物街，因為那些地方充滿生氣。即使他們未必買很多東西，或者未必逗留很久，他們仍然可能很享受那種氣氛，並感受到自己像是某個更大場景中的一部分。",
