                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if two restaurants are side by side and one is empty while the other has a queue outside, many people will instinctively choose the busy one. The same goes for tourist attractions, cafés, and weekend markets: a crowd often creates the impression that the place is worth checking out.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果兩間餐廳並排在一起，一間空空的，另一間外面排滿隊，很多人都會本能地選擇那間多人排隊的。旅遊景點、咖啡店和週末市集也是一樣：人潮往往會讓人覺得那個地方值得去看看。",
