                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, after a long day at work or school, people may want to go for a walk in a park, play basketball, take their children to a playground, or simply sit somewhere pleasant and clear their head. Those simple activities can work wonders, because they help people recharge and stop life from becoming all work and no play.",
