                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, recreational facilities can also bring communities closer together and make a city more attractive for families and visitors.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，康樂設施也能拉近社區之間的距離，並令一座城市對家庭和訪客來說更具吸引力。",
