                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "In Hong Kong, I’d say clothing fashion has become much more casual, diverse, and globally influenced than it used to be.",
                  "textZh": "在香港，我會說服裝時尚比起從前已經變得更加休閒、更加多元，也更受到全球潮流影響。",
