                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, an office worker may choose a simple shirt or blazer that fits well, feels breathable, and can be worn all day comfortably, rather than a trendy item that looks striking but feels stiff and awkward after ten minutes.",
