                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say wearing a uniform has some clear advantages, especially in schools and workplaces, because it can create order, identity, and a stronger sense of equality.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，穿制服確實有一些明顯的好處，尤其是在學校和工作場所，因為它能帶來秩序感、身份認同，以及更強的平等感。",
                  "pages": [
                    81
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    81,
                    81
                  ]
