                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one major advantage of uniforms is that they can reduce unnecessary comparison and help people feel part of something larger than themselves.",
                  "textZh": "所以，制服其中一個主要優點，就是它能減少一些不必要的比較，並讓人感覺自己是更大整體中的一部分。",
