                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, students may dislike heavy uniforms in hot weather, and workers may find certain uniforms uncomfortable, impractical, or simply out of touch with the job they actually do. If people spend the day feeling stiff, overheated, or unable to move freely, the uniform can become more of a burden than a benefit.",
                  "textZh": "例如，學生在天氣炎熱時可能會很討厭厚重的制服，而某些員工也可能覺得制服不舒服、不實用，甚至和他們真正的工作需要脫節。如果人們整天都覺得拘束、悶熱，或者行動不方便，那麼制服就可能變得弊多於利。",
