                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say the professionals who most often need to wear uniforms are those working in public service, healthcare, transport, and other roles where trust, safety, and visibility really matter.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，最常需要穿制服的專業人士，通常是在公共服務、醫療、交通運輸，以及其他講求信任、安全和容易辨認的工作裡的人。",
