                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, police officers, firefighters, paramedics, nurses, pilots, and cabin crew usually wear uniforms. In an emergency, people need to know at a glance who they can turn to. A nurse in scrubs or a firefighter in full gear is not just wearing clothes; they are wearing a role, a duty, and, in a sense, a promise.",
