                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say uniforms are needed in a wide range of professions, from emergency services to customer service, because they build trust, create clarity, and help people know, almost instantly, who is meant to do what.",
