                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a small construction company that knowingly ignores safety rules and puts workers’ lives at risk deserves a serious punishment too. So the real principle should be proportionality rather than a simple big-versus-small approach.",
