                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people choose to work at international companies because they offer a wider horizon. That said, they are not everyone’s cup of tea, because some people would still prefer a smaller workplace with a more personal touch and a better work-life balance.",
