                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "Good after-sales service gives customers peace of mind. If something goes wrong, people want to know that the company will step up, answer questions, solve problems, and honour its promises. Especially when a product is expensive, technical, or meant to last for years, support is not just a bonus; it is part of the value itself. In a way, after-sales service is where a company really shows its true colours.",
