                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "These days, customers do not just buy a product; they buy the whole experience. If a company is helpful after the sale, people are more likely to come back, recommend it to others, and feel that they are in safe hands. By contrast, if a business takes the money and then goes silent, word can spread very quickly. In today’s world, reputation can take years to build and only minutes to dent, so good after-sales service is not just customer care; it is smart business.",
