                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I also feel happy when I am making progress, learning something new, or doing something that gives me a sense of purpose.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，當我在進步、學到新東西，或者做一些讓我覺得有意義的事情時，我也會感到快樂。",
