                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, to me, maintaining service quality starts with strong foundations, because when staff are well-trained and expectations are clear, the public is much more likely to receive reliable service.",
