                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Not necessarily. I think talent can make some parts of life easier, but it does not automatically make a person happier.",
                  "textZh": "不一定。我認為天賦的確可以令人生某些部分變得比較順利，但它並不會自動令一個人更快樂。",
