                  "number": 2,
                  "sourceNumber": 2,
                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "Deep down, people have always wanted the same basic things: love, security, good health, a sense of belonging, and the feeling that life is going somewhere. Those are timeless. Whether it is today or fifty years ago, most people are still happiest when they feel cared for, understood, and emotionally at ease. In that sense, the heart of happiness has not really moved; it still beats to a very human rhythm.",
                  "textZh": "說到底，人一直以來想要的基本東西其實都差不多：愛、安全感、健康、歸屬感，以及覺得人生有方向的感覺。這些都是不受時代限制的。無論是今天還是五十年前，當大多數人感到被關心、被理解，以及內心安穩時，他們通常都會最快樂。從這個角度來說，快樂的核心其實沒有真正改變；它依然跟隨着很人性的節奏在跳動。",
