                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the foundations of happiness are much the same, but the forms it takes have evolved with society. Times change, tools change, lifestyles change — but the human heart still looks for warmth, meaning, and connection.",
