                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, people also need to arrive early in situations where punctuality shows respect or helps things run smoothly for everyone else.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，在那些守時本身代表尊重，或者能令整體安排更順暢的情況下，人們也應該提早到達。",
