                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "Some people come alive at night, whereas others seem to bloom in the morning, and he is definitely the second type. If he gets up early, he tends to feel fresh, productive, and ready to take on the day. If he sleeps in too late, he actually feels a bit sluggish, as though the day has slipped through his fingers before it has even properly begun. So, for him, waking up early is not just a habit; it sets the tone for everything that follows.",
