                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think one of the main reasons is that advice can feel personal, almost as if someone is shining a light on your weaknesses or blind spots.",
                  "textZh": "我認為其中一個主要原因是，建議很多時候會令人覺得很針對自己，彷彿有人把燈直接照向你的弱點或盲點。",
