                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a student is told by a parent or teacher that they should change their study habits, they may become defensive straight away. Deep down, they may know the advice makes sense, but in that moment it can hit a nerve, so their first reaction is to push back rather than listen.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個學生被父母或老師說應該改變自己的讀書習慣，他很可能會立刻進入防禦狀態。說到底，他內心未必不知道那些建議是有道理的，但在那一刻，那些話很容易觸到他的痛處，所以他的第一反應往往不是聆聽，而是反抗。",
                  "pages": [
                    5
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    5,
                    5
                  ]
