                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, in many cases, accepting advice is difficult because emotion gets there first, while reason arrives a little later.",
                  "textZh": "所以，在很多情況下，人之所以難以接受建議，是因為情緒往往先到，理性則慢半拍才跟上。",
                  "pages": [
                    5
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    5,
                    5
                  ]
