                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say it is very important, especially when the decision is serious, long-term, or difficult to reverse.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，這是非常重要的，尤其當那個決定影響重大、牽涉長遠，或者一旦做了就很難回頭的時候。",
