                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, in most cases, getting advice is a smart move, because it helps people make better-informed and more balanced decisions.",
                  "textZh": "所以，在大多數情況下，聽取別人的意見都是明智之舉，因為這能幫助人們作出更有根據、也更平衡的決定。",
