                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think people should rely on advice too heavily, because at the end of the day, the decision still has to be their own.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為人們應該過度依賴別人的意見，因為說到底，決定始終還是要自己去作。",
