                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "Advice can guide you, but it cannot live your life for you. If someone asks too many people, they may end up with so many voices in their ear that they cannot hear their own thoughts anymore. One person says go left, another says go right, and before long, the whole thing becomes more noise than guidance. So yes, advice matters, but judgment matters just as much. The wisest approach, in my view, is to listen widely, think carefully, and then decide for yourself.",
                  "textZh": "建議可以引導你，但不能代替你活你的人生。如果一個人問太多人，他耳邊可能會充滿各種聲音，最後連自己的想法也聽不清。一個人叫他向左，另一個人叫他向右，久而久之，整件事就可能變得更像噪音，而不是幫助。所以，沒錯，意見很重要，但判斷力同樣重要。在我看來，最明智的做法就是：廣泛地聽、冷靜地想，然後由自己作最後決定。",
