                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a student is choosing a university subject, family members may prefer something practical, while friends may encourage whatever sounds exciting. Both views may carry some weight, but the student is the one who has to study it for years. If they follow other people blindly, they may end up living someone else’s plan instead of their own.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位學生正在選擇大學科目，家人可能會偏向較實際的選擇，而朋友則可能鼓勵他追求聽起來更有趣的方向。這兩種意見都可能有一定道理，但真正要讀那個科目好幾年的人，始終是那位學生自己。如果他盲目跟從別人的想法，最後他可能活成了別人的計劃，而不是自己的。",
