                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a student might choose a university subject because their parents approve of it, even though their real interest lies somewhere else. They may keep the peace for a while, but later they could lose motivation or even resent the choice, simply because it was never truly theirs in the first place.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個學生可能會因為父母認同某個大學學科，就選擇去讀它，即使自己真正有興趣的是別的方向。短期內，他也許能維持表面的和諧，但之後很可能會失去動力，甚至對這個決定產生怨氣，因為那從來都不是他真正想走的路。",
