                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if someone wants to move abroad for work, they should absolutely think about their own ambitions, but they should also consider how that move might affect their partner, children, or elderly parents. Otherwise, a decision that benefits one person may place too heavy a burden on everyone else.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人想為了工作搬到海外，他當然應該考慮自己的理想和發展，但同時也需要想想這個決定會怎樣影響伴侶、孩子，或者年老的父母。否則，一個對自己有利的決定，可能會把過重的負擔壓到其他人身上。",
