                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say it is better to think first about what you want, while still taking other people’s needs seriously. The best decisions are usually the ones in which you stay true to yourself without forgetting that your choices can also touch other people’s lives.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說做決定時，先考慮自己真正想要甚麼通常是比較好的，但同時也要認真看待別人的需要。最好的決定，通常不是自私到底，也不是一味委屈自己，而是既能忠於自己，也不忘記自己的選擇會影響身邊的人。",
