                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one common way people socialise with neighbours is through repeated everyday contact that slowly builds trust and ease.",
                  "textZh": "所以，人們和鄰居來往的一個常見方式，就是透過日常生活中不斷重複的小接觸，慢慢建立信任和自在感。",
                  "pages": [
                    19
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    19,
                    19
                  ]
