                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another important way people socialise with neighbours is through shared activities or small acts of mutual help.",
                  "textZh": "另一個很重要的方式，就是透過共同活動，或者一些彼此幫忙的小事來和鄰居建立關係。",
