                  "textEn": "For instance, it is now quite common to see people choosing salads, high-protein meals, oat milk, or sugar-free drinks, which would have been far less common years ago. At the same time, it is also common to see people ordering fried food and bubble tea late at night. In other words, people today can eat more wisely, but they can also eat more wildly.",
                  "textZh": "例如，現在人們選擇沙律、高蛋白餐、燕麥奶，或者無糖飲品，其實已經相當常見，而這些在很多年前是少得多的。同一時間，現在也很常見有人在深夜叫炸物和珍珠奶茶。換句話說，今天的人可以吃得更聰明，但也可以吃得更放縱。",
