                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say eating habits in Hong Kong have shifted from being more traditional, routine-based, and home-oriented to being more fast-paced, varied, and individualised. Still, even though the habits have changed, food remains a big part of social life and cultural identity, so the heart of it has not disappeared.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說香港的飲食習慣已經由較傳統、較有規律、也較以家庭為中心的模式，轉變為更快節奏、更多元、也更個人化的模式。不過，儘管習慣變了，食物仍然是社交生活和文化身份中很重要的一部分，所以它最核心的價值其實並沒有消失。",
