                  "textEn": "Food is not just something that fills the stomach; it is the fuel that keeps the body running. If people live on greasy takeaway food, sugary drinks, or highly processed snacks, they may feel sluggish, gain weight, or run into health problems sooner or later. By contrast, a balanced diet can help people stay energetic, think more clearly, and keep their body in better shape. In that sense, diet is a bit like the foundation of a house: if the base is weak, everything built on top of it becomes less stable.",
                  "textZh": "食物不只是拿來填飽肚子的東西；它其實是讓身體運作的燃料。如果一個人長期靠油膩外賣、含糖飲品，或者高度加工的小食過日子，他遲早可能會變得沒精神、體重上升，甚至出現健康問題。相反，均衡飲食能幫助人保持活力、思路更清晰，也讓身體狀態更穩定。從這個角度來說，飲食有點像一間房子的地基：如果底子不穩，上面的一切也很難真正穩固。",
