                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think having an important diet means people need to eat perfectly all the time or turn every meal into a source of stress.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我不認為飲食重要就代表人一定要每一餐都吃得完美，或者把吃東西這件事變成一種壓力來源。",
