                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone who usually eats nutritious home-cooked meals can still enjoy a burger or a slice of cake now and then without ruining their health. It is the overall pattern that counts, not one meal here and there.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個平時主要吃有營養家常菜的人，偶爾吃一個漢堡包，或者一塊蛋糕，其實並不會因此毀掉健康。真正重要的是整體模式，而不是某一餐半餐。",
