                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that modern life is already fast-paced, and that trend is unlikely to slow down. As people get busier, they will probably rely more on ready-made meals, food delivery, smart kitchen technology, and diets tailored to their own needs. In other words, people may eat with one eye on convenience and the other on efficiency. Food will not just be about taste; it will also be about speed, flexibility, and fitting into a packed schedule.",
