                  "textEn": "For instance, it may become normal for families to buy plant-based meat, low-sugar drinks, or locally sourced food as part of everyday life. On the other hand, younger people who are short on time may still fall back on late-night delivery, snack foods, and quick fixes when life gets hectic.",
                  "textZh": "例如，將來家庭把植物肉、低糖飲品，或者本地食材當成日常選擇，可能會變得很普通。另一方面，那些時間緊迫的年輕人，在生活忙得喘不過氣時，仍然可能會回到宵夜外賣、零食，以及各種快速解決方案之上。",
                  "pages": [
                    40
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    40,
                    40
                  ]
