                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say education today is generally broader and more future-focused than it used to be. In the past, the priority was often more about discipline, basic knowledge, and exam results.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，今天的教育整體上比過去更廣闊，也更着眼未來。過去的重點往往更集中在紀律、基礎知識，以及考試成績上。",
