                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another major difference is that schools today tend to care more about the whole child, not just the report card.",
                  "textZh": "另一個很大的分別是，今天的學校往往比過去更重視孩子的整體發展，而不只是成績表。",
