                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, some students can fill in the blanks perfectly or recite a long list of grammar points, but they still struggle to order a meal, ask for directions, or keep a simple conversation going. In that case, the language has stayed on the page instead of making the leap into real life.",
                  "textZh": "例如，有些學生可以非常準確地完成填充題，或者背出一長串文法重點，但他們仍然可能不懂得如何點餐、如何問路，或者如何把一段簡單對話自然地說下去。這種情況下，語言其實仍然停留在紙上，未真正跨進現實生活。",
