                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I think language classes could become far more effective if schools taught language as a tool for connection rather than just a subject to pass.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為，如果學校把語言視為一種用來連結他人的工具，而不只是要考及格的一個科目，那麼語言課其實可以變得有效得多。",
