                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think classrooms in the near future will become more digital, more interactive, and more student-centred. However, even if the tools change, I do not think the human side of teaching will disappear, because a good teacher still plays a key role in inspiring, guiding, and bringing learning to life.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為未來的課堂會變得更數碼化、更互動，也更以學生為中心。不過，即使工具改變了，我也不認為教學中「以人為本」的那一面會消失，因為一位好的老師始終在啟發學生、引導方向，以及讓學習真正活起來這方面扮演關鍵角色。",
