                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, if I had to rank them, smartphones would come first without a shadow of a doubt, while laptops, tablets, and wearables would follow close behind.",
                  "textZh": "所以，如果一定要排次序，我會毫不猶豫地把智能手機放在第一位，而手提電腦、平板電腦和穿戴式裝置則緊隨其後。",
