                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, the most popular device often depends on what people need it for, because different tools shine in different situations.",
                  "textZh": "不過，最受歡迎的設備其實也取決於人們想用它來做甚麼，因為不同工具在不同情境下各有優勢。",
