                  "number": 2,
                  "sourceNumber": 6,
                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "A phone may rule the roost for convenience, but it is not always the best tool for every task. When people need to write at length, design something, or work in depth, laptops still hold their ground. In the same way, tablets are useful for reading and media, while wearables are popular because they are quick, light, and always on hand. So the picture is not one-size-fits-all; it is more a case of one device leading the pack while others play strong supporting roles.",
                  "textZh": "手機在方便程度上也許是一枝獨秀，但它並不一定是每一種工作的最佳工具。當人們需要長時間打字、做設計，或者深入處理工作時，手提電腦仍然站得很穩。同樣地，平板電腦在閱讀和娛樂方面很有優勢，而穿戴式裝置之所以受歡迎，是因為它們快捷、輕便，而且隨手可用。所以，整體情況並不是一刀切的；更準確地說，是一種設備跑在最前面，而其他設備則扮演很強的配角。",
