                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think health-related and wearable devices will become even more popular, because people are paying more attention to well-being than they used to.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也認為和健康有關的穿戴式設備會變得更加受歡迎，因為現在的人比以前更重視身心健康。",
