                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, some people replace their phones every year even though the old one is still fast, reliable, and good enough for everyday use. They may be drawn in by better marketing, a sleeker design, or the feeling that they are missing out. Before they know it, they are paying a premium for a very small jump forward.",
                  "textZh": "例如，有些人每年都會換手機，儘管舊手機其實仍然夠快、夠穩定，而且足以應付日常需要。他們可能是被更厲害的宣傳、更流線的設計，或者一種「怕自己落後」的感覺吸引住。等他們回過神來，其實已經為一點點小升級付出了很高的代價。",
