                  "sourceNumber": 5,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I would not say all spending on electronic devices is excessive, because these days many of them are no longer luxuries; they are basic tools for modern life.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不會說所有在電子產品上的花費都是過度的，因為在今天，很多電子產品早已不再是奢侈品，而是現代生活中的基本工具。",
