                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a university student may need a good laptop for essays, research, and online classes, while an office worker may need a dependable phone and computer to stay productive. In those cases, paying more for quality can actually save trouble, time, and money in the long run.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個大學生可能真的需要一部好的手提電腦去寫論文、做研究，以及上網課；而一位上班族也可能需要一部可靠的手機和電腦來維持工作效率。在這些情況下，多花一點錢買高質素的產品，長遠來說反而可能省下更多麻煩、時間，甚至金錢。",
