                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if someone uses their phone as an alarm clock, diary, map, wallet, and way of keeping in touch, losing it for even half a day can feel like losing a small part of their life. They may not know where to go, how to pay, or whom to contact. That kind of dependence can be quite unsettling.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人把手機當作鬧鐘、記事本、地圖、錢包，以及聯絡別人的主要工具，那麼即使只是丟失半天，都可能令人覺得像失去了一小部分生活。他可能不知道要怎樣去目的地、怎樣付款，或者怎樣聯絡別人。這種依賴感其實相當令人不安。",
                  "pages": [
                    14
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    14,
                    14
                  ]
