                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think such a world might also feel simpler, quieter, and perhaps a little more human in some respects.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我的確也認為，這樣的世界在某些方面可能會顯得更簡單、更安靜，甚至更有人味。",
