                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if beaches, rivers, or coastal areas are filled with rubbish or contaminated water, that can affect fish, damage ecosystems, and even make people think twice about swimming or spending time there. In a city like Hong Kong, where the harbour and coastline are such a visible part of daily life, pollution really hits close to home.",
