                  "textEn": "Governments, schools, and environmental groups are putting more emphasis on cleaning up beaches, reducing waste, and protecting waterways. So, while pollution is still a real issue, it is not as if people are simply turning a blind eye to it. In fact, the more seriously society takes it, the better the chances of stopping the problem from snowballing.",
                  "textZh": "政府、學校，以及環保團體都愈來愈重視清潔海灘、減少廢物，以及保護水道。所以，雖然污染依然是一個真實問題，但也不是說大家完全視而不見。事實上，社會愈認真看待它，就愈有機會防止問題愈滾愈大。",
