                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if certain animals disappear from an ecosystem, it can affect the food chain, plant life, and even farming in the long run. Bees are a simple example. They may look small, but they play a huge role in pollination. If we lose them, the effects would ripple far beyond the natural world.",
