                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think individuals can help keep water clean by changing their own habits and encouraging others to do the same. They may not be able to turn the whole situation around single-handedly, but they can absolutely be part of the solution rather than part of the problem.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為個人可以透過改變自己的習慣，以及鼓勵別人一起做，來幫助保持水源清潔。他們未必能夠一手扭轉整個局面，但他們絕對可以成為問題變好而不是變壞的一部分。",
