                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one major reward children get from school is a strong academic and practical foundation that can serve them for years to come.",
                  "textZh": "所以，孩子從學校得到的一個重要回報，就是一個扎實的學術和實際能力基礎，而這種基礎能在往後很多年裡持續幫助他們。",
                  "pages": [
                    55
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    55,
                    55
                  ]
