                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say the rewards children get from school are not only academic. They also gain character, confidence, and life skills, and in many ways those rewards are worth just as much as the grades on a report card.",
