                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think rewards always have to be financial, because many employees also value recognition, trust, and personal growth.",
