                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a young employee shows strong potential, a company might sponsor a professional course, assign them a mentor, or let them take charge of an important task. That may not feel flashy on the surface, but in the long run it can be worth its weight in gold.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位年輕員工展現出很強的潛力，公司可以資助他讀專業課程、安排一位導師帶領他，或者讓他負責一項重要任務。這些獎勵表面上未必特別耀眼，但從長遠來看，往往非常有價值。",
