                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say companies can reward outstanding employees in both material and non-material ways, from bonuses and promotions to trust and development opportunities. In the end, the best reward is one that not only says “well done,” but also gives people a reason to stay, grow, and keep doing their best.",
