                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "When people know they are being compared with others, they often work harder, think more creatively, and raise their game. In that sense, competition can act like a spark: it wakes people up and gives them a reason to sharpen their skills. Whether in school, sport, or business, a bit of healthy rivalry can bring out focus, ambition, and real growth.",
