                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "I think it stood out because it was more than just a formal celebration. It felt like a room full of shared memories, old friendships, and new beginnings all rolled into one. Everyone was dressed up, the atmosphere was lively, and there was that kind of excitement in the air that you could almost feel with your hands. In a way, it reminded me that some events are not just about what happens on the day, but about what they represent.",
