                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, the banquet was held in the evening at a hotel, and I went there with a few mutual friends. There was a ceremony, speeches, and the usual toasting, but what I remember most clearly was the moment when the couple walked in and the whole room burst into applause. It was simple, but it hit home. You could see how genuinely happy people were for them, and that made the whole evening feel heartfelt rather than just glamorous.",
