                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "What made it even more special was that it also gave me a chance to reconnect with people I had not seen for a long time.",
                  "textZh": "令這個活動更特別的是，它也給了我一個機會，讓我可以再次見到一些很久沒見的人。",
