                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think being a professional athlete is exciting and rewarding, but also incredibly demanding.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，成為一名職業運動員既刺激、也很有回報，但同時也非常艱苦。",
                  "pages": [
                    3
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    3,
                    3
                  ]
