                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, an athlete may spend years preparing for one major event and give up holidays, comfort, and even time with family just to be in peak condition. If they succeed, the reward can be extraordinary. But if things go wrong, the disappointment can hit like a ton of bricks.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一名運動員可能會為了一場重要賽事準備好幾年，放棄假期、舒適生活，甚至和家人相處的時間，只為了讓自己處於最佳狀態。如果他成功了，那份回報當然可能非常巨大；但如果事情出了差錯，那種失望也可能沉重得像一整噸磚頭壓下來一樣。",
