                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say being a professional athlete is a life of high highs and hard lows. It can be deeply fulfilling for people who truly love their sport, but it also demands far more than most people realise.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說成為職業運動員是一種高峰很高、低谷也很深的人生。對那些真正熱愛自己運動項目的人來說，它可以帶來很深的滿足感；不過，它所要求付出的東西，也遠比大多數人想像中更多。",
