                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, now some young people may go indoor skydiving, try ziplining, or spend hours on interactive games that feel almost cinematic. Twenty years ago, people were more likely to get their kicks from things like going to an amusement park, playing team sports, visiting arcades, or simply hanging out with friends outdoors. Both can be exciting, but the flavour of the excitement feels different.",
                  "textZh": "例如，現在有些年輕人可能會去玩室內跳傘、滑索，或者花很多時間玩那些幾乎像電影一樣的互動遊戲。二十年前，人們則更可能從去遊樂場、打團體運動、逛電子遊戲機中心，或者單純和朋友在戶外玩樂之中找到刺激感。兩者都可以很令人興奮，只不過那種興奮的味道不太一樣。",
