                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I also think exciting activities 20 years ago were often more social and more spontaneous, whereas many activities now can feel a bit more individualised or performative.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為，二十年前那些刺激活動往往更講求社交，也更自然隨興；而現在很多活動則可能顯得更個人化，甚至有點表演性。",
