                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say exciting activities now tend to be more high-tech, more varied, and sometimes more intense, while activities 20 years ago were often simpler, more face-to-face, and less filtered. Neither is automatically better. Modern activities may offer a bigger buzz, but older ones often had a kind of warmth and spontaneity that is hard to beat.",
