                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone joins a dance class, a yoga lesson, or a sports club for the first time, they may not know the routine, the basic techniques, or even the unspoken etiquette. As a result, they may spend half the time second-guessing themselves instead of actually enjoying the activity.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人第一次去上跳舞課、瑜伽課，或者參加運動社團，他可能不清楚流程、基本技巧，甚至連一些不成文的規矩也不知道。結果，他很可能有一半時間都在懷疑自己做得對不對，而不是真正享受那個活動。",
