                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, I would say the first difficulty is often psychological rather than technical, because a lack of confidence can trip people up before the activity itself really does.",
                  "textZh": "所以，我會說，第一次的困難往往先是心理上的，而不一定只是技術上的，因為很多時候，真正先把人絆住的，不是活動本身，而是信心不足。",
