                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, people can also run into practical problems, such as not being skilled enough yet, underestimating the effort involved, or expecting themselves to improve too quickly.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，人們也可能遇到一些很實際的問題，例如技巧還不夠、低估了活動所需要的投入，或者對自己的進步速度抱有太高期望。",
                  "pages": [
                    18
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    18,
                    18
                  ]
