                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if someone starts hiking, swimming, or learning a musical instrument, they may assume it looks easy from the outside. However, once they actually try it, they may realise it takes stamina, patience, and repeated practice. That can be a bit of a wake-up call.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人開始行山、學游泳，或者學一種樂器，他可能原本以為那些事情看起來很簡單。不過，當他真的去嘗試時，才會發現那需要體力、耐性，以及反覆練習。那往往會成為一個令人清醒過來的提醒。",
