                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think the biggest problems people face when trying new activities for the first time are nervousness, inexperience, and unrealistic expectations. Still, that is all part of the process, and in many cases, the awkward beginning is simply the price of getting better at something new.",
