                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I think it is usually better to do new things with other people, especially when the experience feels unfamiliar or a little intimidating.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我認為嘗試新事物時，通常和其他人一起做會比較好，尤其當那件事很陌生，或者本身有點令人卻步的時候。",
                  "pages": [
                    23
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    23,
                    23
                  ]
