                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone is trying rock climbing, travelling to a new country, or joining a dance class for the first time, going with a friend can make a huge difference. They may still feel nervous, of course, but they are less likely to back out at the last minute. Even if things go slightly wrong, it often turns into a funny memory rather than an uncomfortable one.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人第一次去攀石、去陌生國家旅行，或者參加跳舞班，和朋友一起去往往會帶來很大的分別。當然，他仍然可能會緊張，但臨陣退縮的機會通常會少很多。即使過程中出現一點小尷尬，最後很多時也會變成一段好笑的回憶，而不是一段令人不舒服的經歷。",
