                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say doing new things with other people is usually the easier and more enjoyable way to begin, but doing them alone can be better for personal growth. So, if I had to choose, I would slightly favour doing new things with others first, then doing some of them alone once I feel more ready.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，和別人一起做新事物，通常是比較容易開始、也比較愉快的方式；不過，自己一個人做，往往更有助個人成長。所以，如果一定要選，我會稍微偏向先和別人一起開始，之後等自己準備得更充足時，再嘗試獨自去做其中一些事。",
