                  "textEn": "Personally, no, I do not think it is necessary to spend a lot of money on holding a party, because what people usually remember is the atmosphere, not the bill.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我不認為辦派對一定有必要花很多錢，因為人們通常記得的是氣氛，而不是帳單。",
