                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a birthday party at home with homemade food, a few decorations, and close friends can easily be more memorable than a lavish event in a fancy venue. If people are laughing, talking, and enjoying each other’s company, that already does most of the heavy lifting.",
