                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think some occasions may justify spending more, especially if the event is large, formal, or once in a lifetime.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為某些場合的確值得多花一點錢，尤其是當活動規模較大、較正式，或者一生可能只有一次的時候。",
