                  "textEn": "The reason is that some parties carry more weight than others. A wedding, a milestone birthday, or a graduation celebration may involve many guests, better food, a suitable venue, and smoother organisation, so naturally the cost goes up. In those cases, spending more is not necessarily about showing off; it may simply be about making sure the event runs well and feels special. Still, there is a big difference between spending wisely and breaking the bank for the sake of appearances.",
