                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a couple are holding a wedding for a large family, they may need to spend more on seating, catering, and photography. That can make sense. But if someone pours money into every little detail just to impress other people, then the party may start to feel more like a performance than a celebration.",
