                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if an elderly person needs regular hospital visits, rehabilitation, or even residential care, their children may want to help, but they may not have the time, money, or professional knowledge to do everything themselves. In that kind of situation, public healthcare, subsidies, and community services can make all the difference.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位長者需要定期覆診、做復康，甚至入住護理院舍，他的子女也許很想幫忙，但未必有足夠時間、金錢，或者專業知識去把所有事情都一手包辦。在這種情況下，公共醫療、津貼，以及社區支援服務，就可能帶來很大的分別。",
