                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think grandparents often act as a bridge between generations, although that role may look a little different in modern families.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也覺得祖父母常常像是一道連接不同世代的橋樑，只不過在現代家庭裡，這個角色的表現方式可能和以前有點不同。",
