                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if an older person suddenly eats less, seems more forgetful, or becomes unusually quiet, an observant caregiver may spot the problem early and get help in time. In the same way, a respectful caregiver will ask what the person wants, rather than simply taking over everything. That can make the elderly person feel valued instead of invisible.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位長者突然吃少了、看起來比平常更健忘，或者變得異常沉默，一個有觀察力的照顧者可能會及早察覺問題，並及時尋求幫助。同樣地，一個懂得尊重別人的照顧者會先問長者想怎樣，而不是把所有事情都一手接管。這會讓長者感到自己是被重視的，而不是被忽略的。",
