                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "If someone is calm, warm, and upbeat, they can lift the mood, put people at ease, and make the whole atmosphere feel lighter. By contrast, if a person is tense, negative, or constantly complaining, that feeling can spread as well and make the room feel heavy. In a way, some people walk into a room and brighten it, while others walk in and drain the air out of it. So, energy is not just a private matter; it often sets the tone for everyone else.",
                  "textZh": "如果一個人表現得冷靜、溫和，而且帶點正面的精神，他就能提升氣氛、令別人放鬆下來，也能讓整個環境變得比較輕盈。相反，如果一個人總是緊張、負面，或者不停抱怨，那種感覺同樣也會擴散出去，令整個空間都變得沉重。某程度上，有些人一走進一個房間，就像把光帶了進去；而另一些人一進來，卻像把空氣都抽走了一樣。所以，一個人的能量並不只是私人狀態；它往往會替周圍所有人定下基調。",
