                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think mental work is often paid more highly in many societies, but that does not necessarily mean it is more valuable.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我的確認為，在很多社會裡，腦力勞動通常薪酬較高，但那並不一定代表它就更有價值。",
