                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think children are blank slates, because some of them clearly seem to be born with certain natural advantages.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為孩子是完全沒有先天差異的白紙，因為有些孩子看起來的確天生就帶著某些自然優勢。",
