                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, one child may have a natural ear for music, while another may be quicker with numbers. But if neither of them is given the chance to practise and develop those strengths, the early advantage may fade away. By contrast, a child with average ability but strong support and determination can often outgrow expectations.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個孩子可能天生對音樂特別敏感，另一個則可能在數字方面反應更快。但如果他們都沒有機會去練習和發展那些長處，那種早期優勢也可能慢慢淡下去。相比之下，一個能力只是普通、但得到充分支持而且很肯努力的孩子，往往反而可以超出別人的預期。",
