                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a child whose parents encourage them to read, play an instrument, join clubs, and talk to different kinds of people may gradually become more confident and more versatile. By contrast, someone with fewer chances to explore may never discover what else they could be good at.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個從小被父母鼓勵去閱讀、學樂器、參加活動，以及接觸不同類型的人的孩子，慢慢就可能會變得更有自信，也更多才多藝。相比之下，一個較少機會去探索的人，可能根本沒有機會發現自己原來還可以擅長其他事情。",
