                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think being good at only one thing is necessarily a weakness, because depth often comes from focus.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我並不認為只擅長一件事就一定是弱點，因為很多深度本來就是由專注累積出來的。",
