                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "Some people spread their energy widely, while others pour it into one craft, one profession, or one passion. If someone spends years sharpening the same skill, it is only natural that they become exceptional in that area rather than average at ten others. In other words, some people cast a wide net, while others dig one deep well. Neither path is automatically better; they simply lead to different kinds of strength.",
