                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a concert pianist, a top athlete, or a highly skilled craftsman may not seem especially well-rounded on the surface, but the level they reach often comes from years of single-minded effort. By contrast, someone who tries many things may become adaptable and capable, but not necessarily world-class in one area.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位鋼琴演奏家、頂尖運動員，或者技藝精湛的工匠，表面上看起來未必特別全面，但他們能到達那種水平，往往正是因為多年來一直專心一致。相反，一個甚麼都願意試的人，也許會變得靈活而且能幹，但不一定會在某一方面達到世界級水準。",
