                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think modern society needs talent of all kinds because no society can function well if everyone is good at the same thing.",
                  "textZh": "我認為現代社會需要各種不同類型的人才，因為如果每個人都只擅長同一樣事情，一個社會根本不可能運作得好。",
