                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, in my view, society needs a wide range of talent because different people keep different parts of life running, and all of those parts matter.",
