                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "To be honest, progress is not just about technology, money, or efficiency. It is also about culture, empathy, creativity, and human connection. That is why artistic, athletic, and interpersonal talents matter as well. A society made up only of high achievers in narrowly practical fields might look efficient on paper, but it could feel emotionally flat and spiritually thin. In other words, different talents do not just help society survive; they help it come alive.",
                  "textZh": "老實說，所謂進步並不只是科技、金錢，或者效率的提升。它同樣也關乎文化、同理心、創意，以及人與人之間的連結。正因如此，藝術、運動，以及人際方面的才能也同樣重要。一個如果只有狹義實用型人才所組成的社會，也許在紙面上看起來很有效率，但在情感上可能會顯得平面，在精神上也會顯得單薄。換句話說，不同類型的人才不只是幫助社會「活下去」；他們也讓社會真正「活起來」。",
