                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a talented musician, writer, or film-maker may not build roads or run hospitals, but they can shape how people feel, think, and see the world. In the same way, a great coach, counsellor, or social worker may not generate huge profits, but they can still change lives in ways that numbers cannot fully capture.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位有才華的音樂家、作家，或者電影創作者，也許不會去修路或經營醫院，但他們能夠影響人們的感受、思想，以及看世界的方式。同樣地，一位出色的教練、輔導員，或者社工，也許不會創造龐大利潤，但他們仍然可以用一些數字無法完全衡量的方式去改變別人的人生。",
