                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think modern society needs talent of all kinds because human needs are varied, and a healthy society has to respond to all of them. The best society is not one in which everyone shines in the same way, but one in which different people bring different gifts to the table.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為現代社會需要各種不同類型的人才，因為人的需要本來就是多方面的，而一個健康的社會必須能夠回應這些不同需要。最理想的社會，不是每個人都用同一種方式發光，而是不同的人都能把自己不同的長處帶到桌面上。",
