                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in the past, it was quite common for the father or grandfather to have the final say on important matters such as where the family would live, how money would be spent, or what kind of education the children should receive. Even if other family members had opinions, the senior male figure often carried the greatest authority.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在過去，父親或祖父對一些重要事情有最後決定權是很常見的，例如一家人住在哪裡、金錢怎樣使用，或者孩子應該接受甚麼樣的教育。即使其他家庭成員也有意見，那位年長男性通常仍然擁有最大的權威。",
