                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, traditionally speaking, the head of the family was usually the father or the senior male figure, especially in more old-fashioned households.",
                  "textZh": "所以，從傳統角度來說，一家之主通常是父親，或者家中較資深的男性成員，尤其是在比較傳統的家庭裡。",
                  "pages": [
                    92
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    92,
                    92
                  ]
