                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, in many families today, both parents may discuss major choices together, such as buying a flat, planning their children’s future, or taking care of elderly parents. In some cases, the mother may even be the main breadwinner or the strongest decision-maker, which would have been far less common in the past.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在今天很多家庭裡，父母雙方都會一起商量重大的選擇，例如買樓、規劃孩子的未來，或者照顧年老父母。在某些情況下，母親甚至可能是家中的主要經濟支柱，或者是更有決斷力的一方，而這在過去是少得多的。",
