                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say that in my culture, the father used to be seen as the head of the family much more clearly than today. However, modern family life is moving towards something more shared, more equal, and, I think, more realistic. In many homes now, the real answer is not “one head,” but “two adults working things out together.”",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，在我的文化裡，父親過去的確比現在更明確地被視為一家之主。不過，現代家庭生活正慢慢走向一種更共享、更平等，而且在我看來也更貼近現實的模式。現在很多家庭裡，真正的答案已經不是「一個人作主」，而是「兩個成年人一起把事情處理好」。",
