                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, no, I do not think men are naturally better at decision-making in a family. I think good decisions depend far more on character, judgment, and communication than on gender.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，不，我並不認為男人天生在家庭中更擅長作決定。我認為，好的決定更多取決於一個人的性格、判斷力，以及溝通能力，而不是性別。",
