                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "Family decisions are rarely simple. They often involve money, emotions, children, long-term plans, and the needs of different people, so they require patience as well as logic. In that sense, good decision-making is not a male trait or a female trait; it is a human skill. Some men are calm and decisive, of course, but some women are every bit as practical, thoughtful, and clear-headed. To me, saying men are automatically better is a bit too neat for real life.",
                  "textZh": "家庭中的決定通常很少是簡單的。它們往往牽涉金錢、情緒、孩子、長遠規劃，以及不同人的需要，所以除了理性之外，也需要耐性。從這個角度來說，好的決策能力並不是男性特質，也不是女性特質；它是一種人的能力。當然，有些男人確實冷靜而果斷，但有些女人同樣非常務實、周全，而且頭腦清晰。在我看來，說男人自然比較擅長，其實把現實說得太簡單了。",
