                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in one family, the wife may be better at budgeting, planning ahead, and thinking through the consequences of a decision, while in another family, the husband may be the one who is more level-headed under pressure. It really depends on the people involved rather than the labels attached to them.",
