                  "textEn": "For instance, a husband may take the lead when deciding on a mortgage because he works in finance, while the wife may make the better call on schooling because she has spent more time understanding the child’s personality and needs. In that case, the best decision comes from shared trust, not from male authority.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果丈夫本身從事金融工作，他在按揭或貸款方面主導決定就可能較合理；而妻子如果花了更多時間了解孩子的性格和需要，那麼在選學校這件事上，她可能會作出更好的判斷。在這種情況下，最好的決定來自彼此信任，而不是來自男性權威。",
