                  "textEn": "I think traditional festivals are very important because they help people preserve culture, strengthen relationships, and maintain a sense of identity.",
                  "textZh": "我認為傳統節日非常重要，因為它們能幫助人們保存文化、加強人與人之間的關係，並維持身份認同感。",
