                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another important role of traditional festivals is that they bring people together and give them a break from the routine of everyday life.",
                  "textZh": "傳統節日的另一個重要作用，就是它們能把人們聚在一起，並讓大家暫時從日常生活的規律中抽離出來。",
