                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, even family members who are busy all year may make a special effort to come home during an important festival. They may share a meal, exchange greetings, and put everyday stress to one side for a while. That kind of reunion can mend small distances before they grow into bigger ones.",
                  "textZh": "例如，即使一家人平日一年到頭都很忙，他們在重要節日來臨時，往往仍然會特地回家團聚。他們可能會一起吃飯、互相問候，並且暫時把日常壓力放到一邊。這樣的重聚很多時能在一些小距離還沒變成大隔閡之前，就先把它修補起來。",
