                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say one big difference is that festivals in the past were often more traditional, more family-centred, and more closely tied to custom, whereas festivals today can feel more commercial and fast-moving.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，其中一個很大的分別是，過去的節日通常更傳統、更以家庭為中心，也和習俗連得更緊；而今天的節日有時則會顯得更商業化，也更節奏急促。",
