                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, during Lunar New Year in the past, families were more likely to spend a lot of time preparing food at home, visiting relatives in person, and following customs quite carefully. Now, many people still do those things, of course, but some may book a restaurant instead of cooking, send digital greetings instead of visiting, or focus more on festive promotions and holiday sales.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在過去的農曆新年裡，家庭通常更常花很多時間在家裡準備食物、親身去拜年，並且較仔細地遵循各種習俗。現在，當然很多人仍然會做這些事，但也有些人可能會訂餐廳而不是自己煮、發電子祝福而不是親身探訪，或者更注意節日促銷和假期購物。",
