                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I also think festivals today are often more open, more varied, and more influenced by modern technology than they were before.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為，今天的節日通常比以前更開放、更多樣化，也更受到現代科技影響。",
