                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, in the past, if family members lived far away, they might simply miss the celebration altogether. Now, even if they cannot come home, they can still join a video call, send greetings instantly, and share photos in real time. In the same way, younger people today may celebrate both traditional festivals and imported ones, such as Christmas or Halloween, which makes festival culture feel more mixed and more global than it used to.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在過去，如果家庭成員住得很遠，他們可能就真的會完全錯過節日聚會。現在，即使他們不能回家，也仍然可以透過視像通話參與、即時送上祝福，並且同步分享照片。同樣地，今天的年輕人也可能同時慶祝傳統節日和外來節日，例如聖誕節或萬聖節，這令節日文化比以前更混合，也更全球化。",
