                  "number": 2,
                  "sourceNumber": 2,
                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The reason is that traditional festivals are not just dates on a calendar. They carry stories, values, family memories, and a sense of cultural belonging. In a way, they are part of a child’s roots. If children never take part in them at all, they may miss out on something deeper than just food or decoration; they may miss a connection to where they come from.",
                  "textZh": "原因在於，傳統節日並不只是日曆上的某幾天而已。它們承載著故事、價值觀、家庭回憶，以及一種文化歸屬感。某程度上，它們就像孩子成長中的根。如果孩子從來都不參與，他們錯過的其實不只是食物或裝飾，而是和自己來處的一種連結。",
                  "pages": [
                    108
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    108,
                    108
                  ]
