                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a child may not enjoy every formal custom, but they may still connect with the festival by helping to make festive food, carrying a lantern, or spending time with grandparents. That kind of experience feels far more alive than simply being told, “You must do this because it is tradition.”",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個孩子未必會喜歡每一種很正式的習俗，但他仍然可能透過幫忙做節日食物、提燈籠，或者陪祖父母一起過節，而和那個節日建立連結。這種經驗通常會比單純被告知「因為這是傳統，所以你一定要做」來得更真實、更有生命力。",
