                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I do not think it is fair to say children are wrong if they do not celebrate traditional festivals, but I do think it is a loss if they never get the chance to engage with them. The best approach, in my view, is not to force tradition on children, but to let them grow into it and feel its value for themselves.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我不認為可以簡單地說，孩子如果不慶祝傳統節日就是錯的；但如果他們從來沒有機會接觸和參與，那的確是一種可惜。在我看來，最好的做法不是把傳統硬塞給孩子，而是讓他們慢慢走進去，自己感受到當中的價值。",
