                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, I definitely think they should, because traditions help young people understand where they come from and what has shaped their community.",
                  "textZh": "是的，我的確認為他們應該學習，因為傳統能幫助年輕人明白自己從哪裡來，以及甚麼塑造了他們所屬的社群。",
