                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, when teenagers learn about traditional festivals, family rituals, or even the meaning behind certain foods and greetings, they often start to see that these things are not random. A Lunar New Year meal, a Mid-Autumn gathering, or a simple act of showing respect to elders can teach them something about gratitude, belonging, and shared history.",
                  "textZh": "例如，當青少年去了解傳統節日、家庭習俗，甚至某些食物和問候方式背後的意義時，他們往往會開始明白，這些事情並不是毫無原因的。一頓農曆新年團年飯、一場中秋相聚，或者一個尊重長輩的簡單舉動，都可以讓他們學到感恩、歸屬感，以及共同歷史的重要性。",
