                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think traditions should be taught in a rigid or unquestioning way.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為傳統應該以一種僵化、或者不容質疑的方式去教導。",
