                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think modern food is better across the board, because some of it is more processed, less wholesome, and a little too fast for its own good.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為現代食物在每一方面都比較好，因為其中有不少食物更加加工化、沒有那麼天然，而且某程度上也快得有點過了頭。",
