                  "textEn": "The main reason is that deep friendships usually bring trust, honesty, and real emotional support. When life is smooth, almost anyone can share a laugh with you. But when the chips are down, it is usually a small circle that truly shows up. To me, friendship is less about numbers and more about depth. A few close friends can feel like solid ground in a world that sometimes shifts under your feet.",
