                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone has a close friend from Japan, Brazil, or France, they may naturally learn about different food habits, communication styles, festivals, or even attitudes towards work and family. That kind of learning does not feel forced at all; it just grows out of ordinary conversation and shared experience.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人有一位來自日本、巴西，或者法國的好朋友，他很自然就可能會接觸到不同的飲食習慣、溝通方式、節日文化，甚至對工作和家庭的看法。這種學習完全不會讓人覺得刻意，因為它只是從平常對話和共同經歷裡慢慢長出來。",
