                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, in that sense, having friends from other countries is important, because it helps people grow in understanding, empathy, and perspective.",
                  "textZh": "所以，從這個角度來看，擁有來自其他國家的朋友是重要的，因為這能幫助人們在理解力、同理心，以及看事情的角度上成長。",
