                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if you travel abroad and already know someone there, the place may no longer feel like just a destination on a map. It feels warmer, more alive, and more personal. Even staying at home, you might celebrate a foreign festival with them, pick up a few phrases in their language, or simply laugh at how differently both of you see the same situation.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果你去外國旅行，而你剛好已經認識那裡的一位朋友，那個地方對你來說就不再只是地圖上的一個目的地，而會變得更溫暖、更有生命感，也更有個人意義。即使你留在自己居住的地方，你也可能會和對方一起過外國節日、學幾句他們的語言，或者單純因為大家對同一件事有不同看法而笑出來。",
                  "pages": [
                    33
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    33,
                    33
                  ]
