                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say it is definitely important to have friends from other countries if the opportunity comes your way. They can make you more open-minded, more culturally aware, and more connected to the wider world. This kind of friendship may not be essential in life, but it is often one of life’s most valuable gifts.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，如果有機會的話，擁有來自其他國家的朋友絕對是很重要的。他們能令你變得更開放、更有文化意識，也更能和更大的世界建立連結。這種友情未必是人生的必需品，但它往往是人生很值得擁有的禮物。",
