                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a young couple move into a new flat, they will probably buy essentials such as a bed, a sofa, a dining table, and storage cabinets. In a small city like Hong Kong, they may also look for furniture that saves space, such as foldable tables or beds with built-in storage.",
