                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another common situation is when old furniture wears out, or when people’s lifestyle changes and their home needs to adapt.",
                  "textZh": "另一個很常見的情況，就是舊家具用舊了、壞了，或者人們的生活方式改變了，而家居也需要跟着調整。",
