                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, during the rise of remote work, many people started buying desks, office chairs, or compact storage units so they could work more comfortably at home. In the same way, families with a new baby may buy a cot, a changing table, or safer furniture with rounded edges.",
