                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a family wants to buy a new sofa, dining table, or wardrobe, they will often discuss the size, the price, and whether it actually fits the flat. One person may care more about style, but another may focus on storage or comfort, so the final choice is often a compromise.",
