                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "First of all, a good doctor needs strong medical knowledge, sound judgement, and the ability to stay calm under pressure. When someone is ill or frightened, a doctor cannot afford to panic or guess. They need to recognise symptoms, make careful decisions, and choose the right treatment. In other words, a good doctor needs both a sharp mind and a steady hand. Without that, even the best intentions may not amount to much.",
                  "textZh": "首先，一位好醫生必須具備扎實的醫學知識、穩妥的判斷力，以及在壓力下保持冷靜的能力。當病人感到不適或害怕時，醫生不能慌，也不能亂猜。他們需要看懂症狀、仔細作出判斷，並選擇合適的治療方法。換句話說，一位好醫生既要有敏銳的頭腦，也要有穩定的手。否則，即使出發點再好，也未必真正幫得到人。",
