                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say people today are probably more health-conscious than people in the past, but not necessarily healthier overall.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，今天的人大概比以前的人更有健康意識，但未必在整體上真的更健康。",
