                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that people now know much more about health than previous generations did. There is far more information about diet, exercise, sleep, mental health, and preventive care, and a lot of that is right at people’s fingertips. On top of that, medical treatment and health screening are much more advanced than before. So, in theory, people today should have a better shot at staying healthy. We know more, we measure more, and we talk about health more openly.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，現在的人對健康的認識，的確比上一代多得多。現在有更多關於飲食、運動、睡眠、心理健康，以及預防保健的資訊，而且很多都可以隨手取得。除此之外，醫療治療和健康檢查也比以前進步得多。所以，從理論上來說，今天的人本來應該更有機會維持健康。我們知道得更多、量度得更多，也更願意公開談論健康。",
