                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, these days it is quite common for people to go to the gym, count calories, wear fitness trackers, or get regular check-ups. Many people also pay more attention to things like sugar intake, step count, and work-life balance, which would probably have been far less common in the past.",
