                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, an office worker today may spend the whole day sitting, then go home exhausted, order fast food, and sleep too late because they are still checking their phone. Meanwhile, someone from an older generation might have walked more, eaten more home-cooked food, and followed a steadier daily routine without even thinking of it as a “healthy lifestyle.”",
                  "textZh": "例如，今天的一位上班族可能整天都坐著工作，回家後累得不想動，於是叫快餐，然後又因為一直看手機而太晚睡。與此同時，上一代的人可能走得更多、吃更多家常菜，而且日常作息也更穩定，雖然他們未必會把那稱為一種「健康生活方式」。",
