                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, yes, to a certain extent, I do think people need to restructure their lifestyle if they want to improve their health.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，是的，在某程度上，我的確認為人們如果想改善健康，就需要重整自己的生活方式。",
                  "pages": [
                    59
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    59,
                    59
                  ]
