                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, if people want lasting improvement, they often need to reshape the lifestyle that made them unwell in the first place.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，如果人們想要得到長遠而穩定的改善，他們往往就需要重新調整那種一開始令自己變得不健康的生活方式。",
                  "pages": [
                    59
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    59,
                    59
                  ]
