                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, overall, I would say future generations may become more health-conscious, but that does not necessarily mean they will all live more healthily in practice.",
                  "textZh": "所以，整體來說，我會說未來的人也許會變得更有健康意識，但這並不一定代表他們在實際生活中都會過得更健康。",
                  "pages": [
                    69
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    69,
                    69
                  ]
