                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say people in the future may not necessarily exercise more or eat more healthily across the board, but healthy living will probably become more highly valued. In the end, a healthier future will depend not just on awareness, but on whether people are truly willing to turn good intentions into daily habits.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說未來的人未必一定會普遍做更多運動和吃得更健康，但健康生活很可能會變得更加受到重視。說到底，未來會不會更健康，不只取決於知識，更取決於人們是否真的願意把好習慣活出來。",
