                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I would say probably not, or at least not in the same easy and instinctive way as before.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我會說大概沒有，至少不再像以前那樣自然、那樣毫不費力地去信任別人。",
