                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, these days many people would think twice before answering a call from an unknown number, buying something from a stranger online, or clicking on a random link. Years ago, people might have been less suspicious in everyday situations like these. Now, a lot of people feel they have to read the small print of human behaviour, not just the fine print of a contract.",
                  "textZh": "例如，現在很多人看到陌生來電時，都會先想一想才接；在網上向陌生人買東西時，也會格外小心；就連按下一條隨機連結，也會先猶豫一下。以前，人們在這些日常情況下可能未必會那麼多疑。現在，很多人都覺得自己不只是要看清楚合約的小字，連人性的細節也要先看清楚。",
