                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, people today may not trust a stranger immediately, but they may still build strong friendships at work, online, or through shared interests over time. Once that trust is earned, it can be very deep. So the issue is not that trust has vanished into thin air; it is that people now want a firmer foundation before they stand on it.",
