                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one powerful way to encourage children to help others is to show them, day after day, what kindness looks like in real life.",
                  "textZh": "所以，其中一個很有力量的方法，就是日復一日地讓孩子親眼看見，現實生活中的善良到底是甚麼樣子。",
