                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a teacher might ask students to welcome a new classmate, tidy up together after an activity, or make cards for people in a care home. A parent might encourage a child to help set the table or spend time with a grandparent. These may sound like small things, but small seeds often grow into strong habits.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位老師可以請學生主動歡迎新同學、在活動後一起收拾，或者為安老院的人製作心意卡。父母也可以鼓勵孩子幫忙擺餐具，或者花時間陪伴祖父母。這些事情聽起來也許很小，但很多深厚的習慣，本來就是由小小的種子長出來的。",
