                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if one student is good at maths while another is stronger in English, they can help each other before exams. They might go through past papers together, point out mistakes, and keep each other focused instead of panicking alone. In a situation like that, two heads are often better than one.",
