                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "To be honest, school is not only about grades. It is also about confidence, belonging, and getting through difficult days. A kind classmate can include someone who feels left out, encourage a friend who has lost confidence, or simply listen when another student is under stress. At that age, even small gestures can go a long way. A few supportive words can lighten the load more than people realise.",
                  "textZh": "老實說，學校生活不只是關於分數。它同時也關乎自信、歸屬感，以及怎樣熬過那些不容易的日子。一位有善意的同學，可以主動把被冷落的人拉進來、鼓勵一位失去信心的朋友，或者當別人壓力很大時，單純坐下來聽他說話。在那個年紀，即使只是一些小小的舉動，也可以有很大的作用。幾句支持的說話，有時比人們想像中更能減輕壓力。",
