                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a student is having a hard time after getting poor results, their friends may not be able to change the marks, but they can still cheer that person up, study with them, and remind them that one bad test is not the end of the world. That kind of support can stop someone from sinking into self-doubt.",
