                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that history helps me understand how the present came to be. It shows where ideas, traditions, conflicts, and even everyday habits come from. In that sense, history is not just about the past; it is more like a map behind the map. It reminds me that the world did not simply appear out of thin air. Everything has roots, and I find that genuinely fascinating.",
