                  "textEn": "So yes, I do like learning about history, mainly because it gives depth to the present and makes the world feel more understandable.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我喜歡學習歷史，主要因為它能讓現在變得更有深度，也令這個世界變得更容易理解。",
