                  "sourceNumber": 5,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I would not pretend I enjoy every kind of history equally, because the way it is presented makes a huge difference.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不會假裝自己對所有類型的歷史都同樣喜歡，因為它被呈現出來的方式真的有很大影響。",
                  "pages": [
                    26
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    26,
                    26
                  ]
