                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say studying history teaches us both practical wisdom and human understanding. It helps us make better sense of the present, and perhaps make fewer foolish mistakes in the future. History may not hand us all the answers, but it certainly teaches us which questions matter.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說學習歷史同時教會我們實際的智慧，以及對人的理解。它能幫助我們更好地看懂現在，並且也許在未來少犯一些愚蠢的錯誤。歷史未必會直接把所有答案交給我們，但它的確會教會我們，哪些問題才是真正重要的。",
