                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, someone might read about the Second World War in a textbook, but after watching a documentary or visiting a war museum, the topic may suddenly feel much more real and memorable. Facts on the page are useful, of course, but once people can picture the lives behind those facts, the history tends to stick.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人也許會先在課本裡讀到第二次世界大戰，但當他看完一部紀錄片，或者參觀過戰爭博物館之後，那個主題往往會突然變得真實得多，也更容易記住。紙上的事實當然有用，但當人們能夠想像到那些事實背後的人生時，歷史通常就更容易留在腦海裡。",
