                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people can learn about history through books, lessons, documentaries, museums, historical places, and personal stories. The best way, in my opinion, is to use more than one door into the past, because history is far richer when it is studied, seen, and felt.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，人們可以透過書本、課堂、紀錄片、博物館、歷史場所，以及個人故事去了解歷史。在我看來，最好的方式是用不只一道門走進過去，因為當歷史既被學習、被看見，也被感受到時，它才會真正變得豐富而立體。",
