                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, to some extent I do, because films and TV programmes can make history feel far more vivid, engaging, and memorable.",
                  "textZh": "是的，在某程度上我認為可以，因為電影和電視節目能讓歷史顯得更生動、更吸引，也更容易被記住。",
