                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone watches a film about war, a royal family, or a major political event, they may begin to understand not just what happened, but also the mood of the time and the human cost behind it. Even if they do not remember every detail, the story may stay with them and encourage them to read more afterwards.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人看了一套關於戰爭、皇室家族，或者重大政治事件的電影，他可能不只會知道發生了甚麼事，也會開始感受到那個時代的氣氛，以及背後的人性代價。即使他未必記得每一個細節，那個故事仍可能留在他心裡，並促使他之後再去閱讀更多資料。",
