                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone might watch a historical drama and come away with a strong impression of a king, a battle, or a revolution. However, if they later read about it, they may find that some scenes were invented, some timelines were changed, and some personalities were made more dramatic than they really were.",
