                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think the internet is a very good place to learn about history, but only if people use it critically and choose their sources wisely. It can open a window to the past, but people still need clear eyes to see through that window properly.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為互聯網確實是一個很好的歷史學習地方，但前提是人們要有批判思考，並且懂得明智地選擇資料來源。它的確能打開一扇通往過去的窗，但人們仍然需要清醒的眼光，才能真正透過那扇窗看清楚歷史。",
