                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think technology has changed the way people learn about history for the better, because it has made history far more accessible, vivid, and engaging than it used to be.",
                  "textZh": "整體來說，我認為科技確實讓人們學習歷史的方式變得更好了，因為它令歷史比以前更容易接觸、更生動，也更吸引人。",
