                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think technology can be a double-edged sword when it comes to learning history.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為在學習歷史這件事上，科技其實是一把雙刃劍。",
