                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, someone who has been working long hours for months may go away for just a few days, sleep more, walk around a quieter place, and come back feeling much lighter. The holiday may be short, but it can still clear the mental fog and help them feel human again.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個已經連續幾個月長時間工作的人，可能只需要離開幾天，多睡一點、到一個較安靜的地方走走，就能回來時感覺輕鬆得多。那個假期也許不長，但它仍然能把腦中的疲憊感掃走，讓人重新找回一點做人的感覺。",
