                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another important reason is that holidays give people a chance to enjoy new experiences and spend meaningful time with others.",
                  "textZh": "另一個重要原因是，假期能讓人有機會接觸新體驗，也能和別人共度有意義的時光。",
