                  "textEn": "A holiday can open a window onto a different way of living. People may see new places, try unfamiliar food, learn about another culture, or simply do things they never have time to do at home. At the same time, holidays often bring families, couples, or friends closer together, because they are finally able to share time without constantly watching the clock. In other words, a holiday is not only an escape from routine; it is also a chance to make memories that outlast the trip itself.",
