                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say it is very important, because going on holiday together gives families time to reconnect in a way that everyday life often does not.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，這是非常重要的，因為一家人一起去旅行，能讓他們以一種日常生活往往做不到的方式重新建立連結。",
