                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a family goes away for a few days, they may visit new places during the day, then sit down for dinner and talk more naturally than they usually do at home. Even simple things, like taking photos together or getting lost and laughing about it later, can turn into shared memories that stay with people for years.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一家人外出幾天，他們白天也許會一起去新地方，到了晚上又能坐下來吃飯，自然而然地聊更多平時在家未必會聊到的事情。即使只是一些很簡單的事，例如一起拍照，或者一度迷路之後事後笑著回想，也可能會變成多年之後仍然記得的共同回憶。",
