                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a family does not necessarily need to fly abroad to benefit from time together. They might spend one weekend by the beach, go hiking, or stay in a hotel locally and simply enjoy uninterrupted time as a family. If everyone comes back feeling a little warmer towards each other, then the holiday has already done its job.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個家庭其實不一定要飛到外國，才能從相處時間中得到好處。他們可以只是找個週末去海邊、去行山，或者在本地住一晚酒店，單純享受不被打擾的家庭時光。如果大家回來之後，彼此之間多了一點溫度，那這趟旅程其實就已經發揮了它的作用。",
