                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone goes to a new city alone, they might spend half a day in a museum, sit quietly in a café, or walk through side streets without worrying that they are boring anyone else. If they feel like changing the day’s plan at the last minute, they can simply do it.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人獨自去到一個新的城市，他可能會花半天待在博物館、安靜地坐在咖啡店裡，或者在小街小巷慢慢走，而不用擔心自己是不是令同行的人覺得無聊。如果他想在最後一刻改變當天的行程，也可以直接這樣做。",
                  "pages": [
                    49
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    49,
                    49
                  ]
