                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one clear reason people travel alone is that it gives them independence, flexibility, and the chance to enjoy the journey on their own terms.",
