                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say some people go on holiday alone because they want both freedom and inner space. Of course, it is not everyone’s cup of tea, because some people prefer shared memories and company. But for the right person, a solo holiday can be not only enjoyable, but genuinely refreshing.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說有些人獨自去旅行，是因為他們同時想要自由，也想要內在的空間。當然，這並不是每個人都會喜歡的方式，因為有些人更偏好有人陪伴，以及一起創造回憶。不過，對適合的人來說，一趟獨自旅行不但可以很享受，而且真的能令人重新恢復元氣。",
