                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, years ago a family might save up for one main holiday a year and go somewhere fairly predictable. Now, the same family might take a short city break, a beach holiday, or even a last-minute trip abroad, simply because planning everything is quicker and cheaper than before.",
                  "textZh": "例如，以前一個家庭可能會為一年一次的主要假期儲錢，然後去一個比較固定、可預測的地方。現在，同一個家庭卻可能去一次短途城市旅行、一次海灘假期，甚至來一趟臨時決定的海外之旅，因為現在規劃一切都比以前更快，也更便宜。",
