                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that modern life is fast, noisy, and digitally crowded, so many people are no longer looking for a holiday that leaves them more tired than before. Instead, they want something that gives them breathing space. In that sense, future holidays may be less about rushing from one attraction to another and more about slowing down, clearing the mind, and feeling human again. That is why wellness breaks, nature trips, and digital-detox holidays are likely to strike a chord.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，現代生活節奏快、聲音多，而且充滿數碼干擾，所以很多人已經不再想要那種度假完反而更累的假期。相反，他們更想要的是一種能讓自己喘口氣的空間。從這個角度來看，未來的假期可能不再那麼著重於趕場式地看景點，而會更著重放慢下來、整理思緒，以及重新感受到自己作為一個人的狀態。正因如此，養生假期、大自然旅程，以及數碼排毒式假期，很可能會愈來愈打動人。",
