                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I think it is generally better to take a holiday in a foreign country, because it gives people a stronger sense of novelty and a more complete break from everyday life.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我認為一般來說去外國度假會比較好，因為那樣能帶來更強的新鮮感，也能讓人更徹底地從日常生活中抽離。",
