                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that when people travel abroad, everything feels a little different — the language, the food, the streets, the habits, even the rhythm of daily life. That change of scene can be refreshing in a way that is hard to recreate at home. In a sense, a foreign holiday lets people step out of their usual bubble and see the world with fresher eyes. It is not just about taking a rest; it is also about widening your horizons and coming back with a fuller mind.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，當人去到外國旅行時，很多東西都會顯得有點不一樣——語言、食物、街道、生活習慣，甚至整個日常節奏都不同。這種環境上的轉換，往往能帶來一種在本地較難完全複製的新鮮感。某程度上，去外國度假能讓人走出自己平常的生活泡泡，用更新鮮的眼光去看世界。它不只是休息那麼簡單，同時也是開闊眼界，然後帶著更豐富的感受回來。",
