                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think holidays in your own country should be underestimated, because they can be easier, cheaper, and far less stressful.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為本地度假應該被低估，因為它很多時會更方便、更便宜，也更少壓力。",
