                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone in Hong Kong could spend a weekend in Sai Kung, Cheung Chau, or a nice hotel on the waterfront and still feel properly rested. There is no long-haul travel, no complicated planning, and no need to worry about adapting to a new place. Sometimes that simplicity is exactly what people need.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個在香港生活的人，可以去西貢、長洲，或者住一晚海旁酒店過週末，同樣能得到很好的休息。那樣沒有長途交通、沒有複雜的安排，也不需要花力氣去適應一個全新的地方。有時候，這種簡單本身，正正就是人最需要的東西。",
                  "pages": [
                    58
                  ],
