                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say travelling to a foreign country is better if people want excitement, novelty, and a broader experience, whereas staying in their own country is better if they want convenience and a more restful break. So, in the end, the better choice depends on whether a person needs a change of world or simply a change of pace.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，如果一個人想要的是新鮮感、刺激感，以及更開闊的體驗，那麼去外國度假會更好；相反，如果他想要的是方便和真正安穩的休息，那麼在自己地方度假就可能更適合。所以說到底，哪一種更好，其實取決於一個人此刻需要的，是換一個世界，還是換一個節奏。",
