                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think the most common problems people can have on holiday abroad are practical ones, such as language barriers, transport confusion, money issues, and health problems.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，人們在外國度假時最常遇到的問題，通常都是一些很實際的問題，例如語言障礙、交通上的混亂、金錢方面的麻煩，以及健康問題。",
