                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a tourist might take the wrong bus, end up in the wrong area, and then realise their phone battery is dead, so even asking for directions becomes difficult. Or someone may get food poisoning and struggle to explain their symptoms to a doctor. A situation like that can really throw people in at the deep end, especially if they are travelling alone.",
