                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one major set of problems is the practical side of travelling, because once communication breaks down, even ordinary tasks can become surprisingly complicated.",
