                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people can face both practical and cultural problems when they go on holiday in a foreign country. As exciting as travelling can be, it also requires people to adapt, stay calm, and think on their feet.",
