                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a young couple may be happy in a small flat at first, but once they have a child, they may start looking for a bigger place with more room, a better school district, or a shorter commute. In that case, moving is less about desire and more about necessity.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一對年輕夫婦起初可能很滿意住在一個小單位裡，但一旦有了孩子，他們就可能開始尋找一個更大的地方，希望有更多空間、更好的校網，或者更短的通勤時間。在這種情況下，搬家與其說是想不想，不如說是有需要。",
