                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone moves to a new city, they may spend the first few weeks just trying to work out the quickest route to work, find a decent supermarket, or figure out which clinic to visit if they get sick. None of those things sounds dramatic on its own, but together they can make daily life quite tiring.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人搬到一座新城市，他頭幾個星期可能只是在摸索最快的上班路線、尋找一間不錯的超市，或者萬一生病時該去哪一間診所。這些事情單獨看起來都不算很嚴重，但加起來時，日常生活就會變得相當累人。",
