                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one major problem after moving is that everyday life becomes harder before it becomes easier, simply because people have to rebuild their routine from scratch.",
                  "textZh": "所以，搬家後其中一個主要問題就是：在人們重新建立生活規律之前，日常生活往往會先變得更困難，然後才慢慢變得容易。",
