                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people face both practical and emotional problems after moving to a new place. They have to learn how to live in the new environment, but they also have to learn how to belong in it. With time, most people do settle in, but the first stage can be quite unsettling.",
