                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I think moving to a new place from time to time can be good, but moving too frequently is usually more unsettling than beneficial.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我覺得偶爾搬去新地方住是有好處的，但如果搬得太頻密，通常帶來的不安會多過好處。",
