                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "On the positive side, moving can broaden people’s horizons and make them more adaptable. When you arrive in a new place, you have to learn new routines, meet new people, and find your feet again. That process can make people more independent, more open-minded, and less afraid of change. In that sense, a new place can sometimes be a fresh page rather than just a new address.",
                  "textZh": "從正面來看，搬家可以開闊人的眼界，也能令一個人變得更有適應力。當你去到一個新地方時，你要重新熟習新的生活節奏、認識新的人，也要重新站穩陣腳。這個過程可以令人變得更獨立、更開放，也更不怕改變。從這個角度來說，一個新地方有時不只是一個新地址，更像是人生裡的一張新頁。",
