                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a child has to change schools every year or two, they may find it difficult to keep long-term friends or feel truly at home anywhere. Even adults can feel worn out if they have to start from scratch again and again.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子每一兩年就要轉一次學校，他可能會很難維持長久的朋友關係，也很難真正對任何地方產生家的感覺。即使是成年人，如果總是一次又一次重新開始，也同樣可能會感到很疲憊。",
