                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say moving to a new place can be good in moderation, because it encourages growth and flexibility. However, if it happens too often, the excitement can wear thin, and people may start to crave what matters just as much as adventure: stability, familiarity, and a place to call home.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說適度地搬去新地方住是有好處的，因為它能促進成長，也能培養彈性。不過，如果這種事發生得太頻繁，那份新鮮感就可能慢慢變淡，而人也會開始更渴望一些和冒險同樣重要的東西：穩定感、熟悉感，以及一個真正可以稱為家的地方。",
