                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think young adults should gradually work towards independence, rather than staying in their comfort zone forever.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我的確認為年輕成年人應該逐步朝獨立邁進，而不是永遠停留在自己的舒適圈裡。",
