                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one real pleasure of making a home is that it allows people to create a space that feels genuinely theirs, not just somewhere they happen to live.",
                  "textZh": "所以，打造一個家的其中一個真正樂趣，就是它能讓人創造出一個真正屬於自己的空間，而不只是剛好住進去的一個地方。",
