                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the pleasures of making a home lie in both self-expression and emotional connection. It gives people the joy of shaping their surroundings, but also the deeper comfort of building a place where they can truly belong. A house can be found quickly, but a home is made piece by piece.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，打造一個家的樂趣，在於它同時結合了自我表達和情感連結。它一方面給人塑造生活空間的快樂，另一方面也帶來一種更深層的安穩感，讓人真的覺得自己有所歸屬。房子也許可以很快找到，但家是要一點一滴慢慢做出來的。",
