                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "If I had to choose, I would say parents are usually the best people to influence young people’s behaviour, especially in the long run.",
                  "textZh": "如果一定要我選，我會說父母通常是最適合影響年輕人行為的人，尤其從長遠來看更是如此。",
