                  "sourceNumber": 2,
                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that technology is no longer just a tool sitting in the background; it is becoming the water young people swim in. It shapes what they watch, how they communicate, what they buy, what they admire, and even how they think about themselves. When someone spends hours a day online, the screen does not simply reflect their world; little by little, it helps build it. In that sense, digital influence can be quiet, constant, and incredibly powerful.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，科技已經不再只是靜靜放在背景裡的一件工具；它正逐漸變成年輕人成長其中的「環境本身」。它會影響他們看甚麼、如何溝通、買甚麼、欣賞甚麼，甚至如何看待自己。當一個人每天花很多時間在網上時，那塊螢幕不只是反映他的世界；它其實也在一點一滴地塑造那個世界。從這個角度來說，數碼影響力往往安靜、持續，而且非常強大。",
