                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a teenager may pick up fashion trends from short videos, develop opinions from online creators, learn study habits from educational content, and even shape career goals through what they see on social media. Sometimes they do not even realise how much of their taste and thinking is being nudged along.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個青少年可能會從短影片裡吸收穿搭潮流，從網上創作者那裡形成某些看法，從教學內容裡學到讀書方法，甚至透過社交平台上的資訊去塑造自己的職業想像。有時候，他們甚至未必意識到，自己的品味和思考方式其實已經在不知不覺中被推動着。",
