                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think technology will be the whole story, because family, school, and real-life relationships will still matter enormously.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我並不認為科技會是全部，因為家庭、學校，以及真實生活中的人際關係，仍然會非常重要。",
