                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a young person may be heavily influenced by online trends, but if they grow up in a thoughtful family or attend a school that encourages critical thinking, they are much more likely to question what they see instead of swallowing it whole. That kind of grounding can make all the difference.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個年輕人也許會很受網上潮流影響，但如果他成長於一個有思考的家庭，或者就讀一所鼓勵批判思考的學校，他就更有可能去質疑自己看到的東西，而不是照單全收。那種扎實的根基，很多時候真的能帶來很大分別。",
