                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say young people in the future will be influenced most by technology, but whether that influence becomes helpful or harmful will depend a lot on the guidance they receive in real life. The loudest voice may come from the screen, but the wisest one should still come from people.",
