                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "When people hear general advice like “work hard” or “be kind,” it can sound a bit abstract. But when they see those qualities in a real person, the message suddenly lands. A role model makes good values feel more concrete and more reachable. In that sense, a good role model is a bit like a compass: they do not walk the road for you, but they help you keep your direction when life gets confusing.",
                  "textZh": "當人們只聽到一些很籠統的建議，例如「要努力」或者「要善良」時，那些話有時會顯得比較抽象。但當他們在一個真實的人身上看見這些特質時，那種訊息就會一下子變得更有力量。榜樣能令好的價值觀變得更具體，也更像是自己可以做到的事。從這個角度來看，一個好的榜樣有點像指南針：他不會替你走路，但當人生變得混亂時，他能幫你守住方向。",
