                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a student may admire a teacher who is patient, knowledgeable, and fair. Over time, that student may begin to copy not only the teacher’s study habits, but also the way the teacher treats other people. In that case, the role model is shaping both achievement and character.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個學生可能會很欣賞一位有耐性、有知識，而且待人公平的老師。久而久之，那個學生開始模仿的，不只是老師的讀書習慣，也包括老師待人的方式。這種情況下，榜樣其實不只是影響一個人的成績，也在塑造一個人的品格。",
