                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think parents are the only important influence, because teachers and friends can be especially powerful during the teenage years.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為父母是唯一重要的影響來源，因為老師和朋友在青少年時期其實也可以有非常大的影響力。",
