                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a teenager may know from home that smoking or bullying is wrong, but if all their close friends do it, they may still feel pressure to follow the crowd. At the same time, a good teacher who notices the problem early and speaks to that student with patience and firmness may be able to pull them back before things go too far.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個青少年也許從小已經知道吸煙或欺凌是不對的，但如果他身邊所有親近的朋友都在做這些事，他仍然可能會感受到壓力，想要跟著大隊走。同時，一位好的老師如果及早注意到問題，並且用耐心而堅定的方式和那位學生談談，就有可能在事情變得太嚴重之前把他拉回來。",
