                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say young people in the future will be influenced above all by technology, but that influence will be filtered through family, society, and economic reality. In the end, what truly shapes them is not just what appears on the screen, but the wider world behind it.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說未來年輕人最主要會受到科技影響，但這種影響仍然會經過家庭、社會，以及經濟現實的過濾。說到底，真正塑造他們的，不只是螢幕上的內容，而是螢幕背後更廣闊的整個世界。",
