                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "People can shop whenever they like, compare prices in minutes, read reviews, and have things delivered straight to their door. For busy people in particular, that can feel like a lifesaver. Instead of spending half a day travelling from shop to shop, they can find what they need from the comfort of home. In that sense, online shopping is a bit like carrying a whole shopping street around in your pocket.",
