                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, absolutely. I think the Internet is extremely important for education today, because it has opened up learning in a way that previous generations could hardly imagine.",
                  "textZh": "是的，絕對重要。我認為互聯網在今天的教育中非常重要，因為它以一種過去幾代人幾乎難以想像的方式，把學習打開了。",
