                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a student does not understand a maths concept in class, they can go online afterwards and find videos, step-by-step solutions, and extra exercises until the idea finally clicks. In the same way, someone learning a language can listen to native speakers, build vocabulary through apps, and practise with people from other countries instead of being stuck inside one classroom.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個學生在課堂上聽不懂某個數學概念，他之後可以上網找教學影片、一步一步的解題方法，以及額外練習，直到那個概念真正想通為止。同樣地，一個學語言的人也可以聽母語人士說話、透過應用程式累積詞彙，甚至和其他國家的人練習，而不是被困在單一課室裡。",
