                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I would not say the Internet alone can guarantee a good education, because it is a tool, not a teacher in itself.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不會說單靠互聯網就能保證良好的教育，因為它始終是一種工具，而不是老師本身。",
