                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, an office worker might use AI to summarise meeting notes, organise emails, or prepare a first draft of a report. That does not mean the person becomes unnecessary; rather, it means they can spend less time doing the groundwork and more time refining ideas or solving real problems.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位辦公室員工可以利用人工智能去整理會議記錄、分類電郵，或者先起草一份報告的初稿。這並不代表那個人就變得沒有價值；更準確地說，這只是代表他可以少花時間做一些基礎工序，並把更多精力放在完善想法或解決真正的問題上。",
