                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think AI will also create real challenges, because not everyone will benefit from it in the same way.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也的確認為人工智能會帶來真實的挑戰，因為並不是每一個人都能以同樣的方式從中受益。",
                  "pages": [
                    57
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    57,
                    57
                  ]
