                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one key factor in choosing a career is personal fit, because even a good opportunity can become the wrong road if it does not suit the person walking it.",
