                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a graduate may have to choose between a highly paid corporate role and a less lucrative job in a field they truly care about. The better choice depends on their priorities at that stage of life. If they need financial security urgently, the first option may make more sense. If meaning and balance matter more, the second may be the wiser path.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位畢業生可能要在一份高薪企業工作，和一份薪水較低但自己真正有熱情的工作之間作出選擇。哪一個是更好的選擇，其實取決於他在人生那個階段最看重甚麼。如果他當下最迫切需要的是經濟穩定，那第一個選項也許更合理；但如果他更重視意義感和平衡，那第二個選項可能反而是更明智的路。",
