                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say the most important factors are personal fit and practical reality. The best career choice is usually not the one that looks the most impressive, pays the most, or is easiest to explain to other people, but the one that suits who you are and supports the kind of life you want to build.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說最重要的因素，是個人是否適合，以及現實條件是否可行。最好的職業選擇，通常不是最體面、最高薪，或者最容易向別人交代的那一個，而是那份既適合你這個人，又能支撐你想過的人生的工作。",
