                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "Retraining takes time, and bills do not politely wait. If workers are expected to reinvent themselves overnight, many of them will struggle, and quite understandably so. That is why temporary financial support, job-matching services, and responsible behaviour from companies all matter. If businesses save money through automation, they should not simply pocket the gains and walk away; they should help shoulder the transition as well.",
