                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think this problem should be handled by combining retraining with humane support. Technology should move society forward, of course, but it should not pull the rug out from under ordinary workers. Real progress is not just about machines moving faster; it is about people being carried forward as well.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為這個問題應該透過「再培訓」和「有溫度的支援」一起處理。科技當然應該推動社會向前，但不應該把普通勞工腳下的地毯一下子抽走。真正的進步，不只是機器走得更快，而是人也能被一起帶著往前走。",
