                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in a school project or at work, a strong leader today would usually listen to different opinions, divide tasks fairly, and make sure everyone understands the goal. If a problem came up, that person would not just blame others or bark orders; they would try to calm things down and help the group move forward sensibly.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在學校的小組項目裡，或者在職場上，今天一位有能力的領導通常會先聆聽不同意見、公平分配工作，並確保每個人都明白共同目標。如果中途出現問題，那個人不會只顧責怪別人，或者一味發號施令；相反，他會先把局面穩定下來，再幫助整個團隊理性地往前走。",
