                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I see leadership qualities as becoming more human rather than less, even in a more technological future. Truly effective leadership still rests on character and trust, and I do not think that will change. The difference is that future leaders will also need to be more adaptable, more emotionally intelligent, and more capable of guiding people through change.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為即使未來科技色彩更濃，領導特質其實會變得更有人味，而不是更沒有人味。真正有分量的領導，現在靠的是品格與信任，未來也仍然會一樣；只是未來的好領導，還必須更靈活、更有情商，也更有能力帶著人一起穿過變化。",
