                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a young person is under a lot of pressure from school or work, having supportive parents or siblings can make a huge difference. Even a simple conversation at home can help them feel calmer, clearer, and less alone.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位年輕人正承受很大的學業或工作壓力，有支持自己的父母或兄弟姊妹，往往就會帶來很大的分別。很多時候，光是在家裡有一段簡單的對話，就已經能讓他感覺更平靜、更清楚，也沒那麼孤單。",
