                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, strong family relationships are also valuable because they create practical support and long-term stability.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，牢固的家庭關係之所以重要，還在於它能帶來實際支援，以及長遠的穩定感。",
