                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think a leader should usually discuss important decisions with team members, because that leads to better judgment and stronger teamwork. To me, truly strong leadership is not about deciding everything alone or discussing everything endlessly, but about knowing how to balance listening with decisive action.",
