                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, living together like that can also create tension, because too many people under one roof can mean less privacy and more conflict.",
                  "textZh": "不過，這樣住在一起同時也可能帶來壓力，因為太多人同住一屋，往往就代表較少私隱，以及更多摩擦。",
