                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, grandparents may have strong views on how children should be raised, while parents may want to do things in a more modern way. Or a young adult may feel stifled if family members keep asking where they are going, when they are coming back, or how they should live their life.",
                  "textZh": "例如，祖父母可能對如何教養孩子有很強烈的看法，但父母卻可能想用較現代的方式去做。又或者，一個年輕成年人如果總是被家人問要去哪裡、甚麼時候回來，或者應該怎樣過生活，他就可能會覺得很有壓迫感。",
