                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Speaking from a Hong Kong perspective, I would say arriving late is generally frowned upon, especially in formal situations.",
                  "textZh": "如果從香港的角度來說，我會說遲到普遍是不太被接受的，特別是在正式場合裡。",
