                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone turns up late for a job interview or a business meeting in Hong Kong, that can set alarm bells ringing straight away. Even if the person is capable, the first impression may already have slipped through their fingers.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人在香港求職面試或商務會議中遲到，那往往會立刻令人提高警覺。即使那個人本身很有能力，第一印象也可能已經從手中溜走了。",
