                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say the attitude in Hong Kong is that punctuality is important, and lateness is generally disliked, though the level of tolerance depends on the situation. In formal settings, people expect you to be on time; in casual ones, they may give you a little grace, but not a blank cheque.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說香港整體上很重視守時，而遲到普遍是不太受歡迎的，只不過容忍程度會因場合而異。在正式場合裡，人們通常期待你準時；在較隨意的場合裡，他們也許會給你一點寬容，但那並不是無限度的通行證。",
