                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "In Hong Kong, one very clear example would be a job interview, because punctuality there can shape the first impression almost immediately.",
                  "textZh": "在香港，一個非常明顯的例子就是求職面試，因為在那種情況下，是否準時幾乎會立刻影響別人對你的第一印象。",
                  "pages": [
                    5
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    5,
                    5
                  ]
