                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if two candidates are equally capable, but one arrives calmly and on time while the other rushes in late, looking flustered and apologising, the interviewer will almost certainly feel more confident about the first person. Sometimes the interview has not even fully begun, and yet the message has already been sent.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果兩位求職者能力差不多，但其中一位準時而且從容地到達，另一位卻遲到、匆匆忙忙地衝進來，還一臉慌亂地道歉，那麼面試官幾乎一定會對第一位更有信心。有時候，面試甚至還未真正開始，那個訊息其實就已經傳出去了。",
