                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, to me, a job interview is one of the clearest situations in which punctuality matters a great deal, because it can affect both the atmosphere and the outcome.",
                  "textZh": "所以，在我看來，求職面試是其中一種最明顯「準時非常重要」的情況，因為它不但會影響現場氣氛，也可能直接影響最後結果。",
