                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think some activities are more popular simply because they are easier to get into and easier to keep doing.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，有些活動之所以更受歡迎，原因其實很簡單，就是它們比較容易開始，也比較容易持續做下去。",
