                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, walking, going to the gym, or hiking can become very popular because people do not need much special training to begin. They can just put on comfortable clothes, show up, and get started. Something much more demanding, like rock climbing or long-distance cycling, may still attract passionate people, but it is less likely to appeal to the general public.",
                  "textZh": "例如，散步、去健身室，或者行山之所以容易變得很受歡迎，是因為人們不需要很多特別訓練就可以開始。他們只要穿上舒服的衣服，到了現場就能開始。至於一些要求高得多的活動，例如攀石或長途單車，雖然同樣會吸引很有熱情的人，但通常就沒那麼容易吸引大眾。",
