                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one clear reason some activities are more popular is that they are simply more accessible in terms of time, money, effort, and skill.",
                  "textZh": "所以，有些活動比其他活動更受歡迎，其中一個很明顯的原因，就是它們在時間、金錢、體力和技巧方面都更容易讓人接觸。",
