                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a lot of young people start doing an activity together, posting about it, and talking about how fun it is, others may want to try it too. In that case, people are not only joining the activity itself; they are also joining the atmosphere around it.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果很多年輕人開始一起做某項活動，又在網上分享，又不停說它有多好玩，那其他人自然也可能想試一下。在這種情況下，人們參與的其實不只是那個活動本身，也是在加入它周圍那種氣氛。",
