                  "textEn": "For example, when my parents were younger in Hong Kong, they might have spent their free time going out with friends, playing ball games, watching whatever happened to be on TV, or simply hanging around in the neighbourhood. A young person today, however, may spend the same amount of free time watching short videos, gaming online, or chatting through apps without even leaving the room.",
