                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "At the end of the day, people still want the same few things: to relax, to connect, and to enjoy themselves. That is why activities like eating out, travelling, watching films, listening to music, hiking, or spending time with friends are still popular across generations. The tools may change, and the rhythm may change, but human nature does not turn on a dime. In a way, the melody is the same even if the instruments are different.",
