                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, my parents’ generation may have enjoyed going to the cinema or gathering for a meal, and people my age still enjoy those things now. The difference is that today we may discover the film online first, book tickets on an app, and post about the outing afterwards. So the heart of the activity remains, even if the whole experience has been modernised.",
