                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say today’s leisure activities are partly the same and partly different from those in my parents’ youth. The surface has changed quite a lot, but underneath it all, people are still looking for the same old things: fun, rest, and a sense of connection.",
