                  "sourceNumber": 1,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, I definitely think it does, because films can make knowledge feel far more vivid, accessible, and memorable.",
                  "textZh": "是的，我的確認為有，因為電影能讓知識變得更生動、更容易接觸，也更容易留下印象。",
