                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, I would say films can have real educational value, because they make learning more engaging and more human.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我會說電影的確可以有真正的教育價值，因為它能讓學習變得更吸引人，也更有人味。",
