                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I would not say all films are educational in the same way, because a lot depends on what people watch and how critically they watch it.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不會說所有電影都同樣具有教育意義，因為這很大程度上取決於人們看的是甚麼，以及他們是否帶著批判思考去看。",
