                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a student may watch a film about a famous leader or a major war and become genuinely interested in the topic. However, if they then read more and compare different sources, they will learn not only the story itself, but also where the film added drama or left things out.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個學生可能因為看了一套關於著名領袖或重大戰爭的電影，而對那個主題產生真正興趣。不過，如果他之後再去閱讀更多資料、比較不同來源，他學到的就不只是那個故事本身，還包括電影在哪些地方加了戲劇效果，或者省略了哪些內容。",
