                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a documentary about climate change, poverty, or a historical event is likely to focus on evidence, interviews, and real-world consequences. A superhero film or romantic comedy, on the other hand, is usually not trying to educate people in the same direct way; it is trying to entertain them, keep them hooked, and give them a memorable experience.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一部關於氣候變化、貧窮問題，或者歷史事件的紀錄片，通常會集中在證據、訪問，以及現實世界的影響上。相反，一部超級英雄電影或愛情喜劇，通常並不是想用那麼直接的方式去教育觀眾；它更多是想娛樂他們、抓住他們的注意力，並帶來一段令人難忘的觀影體驗。",
