                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say documentary films are less popular mainly because they compete with lighter and more escapist forms of entertainment. At the same time, when they are well made, they can still hit home in a very powerful way.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說紀錄片之所以沒有那麼受歡迎，主要是因為它們要和那些更輕鬆、也更容易讓人暫時逃離現實的娛樂形式競爭。不過，當紀錄片拍得好的時候，它們依然可以以一種很有力量的方式打動人心。",
