                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think some films can cross generational lines and appeal to almost everyone.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我的確認為，有些電影是可以跨越世代界線，幾乎讓所有年齡層都喜歡的。",
