                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, some animated films are loved by both children and adults. Children may laugh at the funny characters, while parents or older viewers may be touched by the themes of growing up, sacrifice, or belonging. The same film lands differently, but it still lands.",
                  "textZh": "例如，有些動畫電影同時深受小朋友和成年人喜愛。小朋友可能會被有趣的角色逗笑，而父母或其他年長觀眾則可能會被當中關於成長、犧牲，或者歸屬感的主題打動。同一套電影落在不同人心上的方式不一樣，但它仍然能打中人。",
