          "index": 22,
          "title": "Which do you think is better, a detective movie or its original novel?",
          "titleZh": "你認為哪一個比較好：偵探電影，還是它原本的小說？",
          "cueText": "Which do you think is better, a detective movie or its original novel?\n你認為哪一個比較好：偵探電影，還是它原本的小說？",
          "question": {
            "english": "Which do you think is better, a detective movie or its original novel?",
            "chinese": "你認為哪一個比較好：偵探電影，還是它原本的小說？"
          },
          "categoryId": "leisure-activities",
