                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a student who has slept badly before an exam may forget facts they actually know, or a stressed office worker may miss a meeting even though they were told about it earlier. In those cases, the problem is not knowledge alone; it is the condition of the mind.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位考試前睡眠不足的學生，可能會忘記自己其實本來懂得的內容；又或者，一位壓力很大的上班族，明明之前已經被通知過會議時間，卻仍然可能忘記。在這些情況下，問題不只是知識本身，而是整個心理狀態。",
