                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that the consequences are often wider and more serious. A business meeting may involve other people’s time, company plans, money, deadlines, or professional trust. If you forget it, the damage can spread beyond one awkward moment. In other words, missing a business meeting is not just forgetfulness; it can look like carelessness, and that can dent your credibility very quickly.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，它帶來的後果通常更廣，也更嚴重。商務會議很多時牽涉到別人的時間、公司的安排、金錢、截止日期，或者專業上的信任。如果你忘記了，影響往往不只是一個尷尬時刻那麼簡單。換句話說，忘記商務會議不只是健忘而已；它很容易被看成不小心，而這很快就會損害一個人的可信度。",
