                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people want to remember their family history because it gives them roots, lessons, and a bridge between past and present. It reminds them that a family is not just made of the people living now, but also of the lives, struggles, and love that came before.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說人們想記住家族歷史，是因為它能帶來根、帶來教訓，也在過去和現在之間搭起一座橋。它提醒人們，一個家庭不只是由此刻活着的人組成的，也同樣由那些曾經存在過的生命、掙扎，以及愛所構成。",
                  "pages": [
                    86
                  ],
