                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the best way to learn more about your family history is to combine conversation with evidence: ask questions, listen carefully, keep notes, and piece it together bit by bit. Family history is a bit like a puzzle; every story, photo, and document gives you another piece.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，要更了解自己的家族歷史，最好的方法就是把對話和資料結合起來：多問問題、細心聆聽、做些記錄，然後一點一點把它拼起來。家族歷史有點像一幅拼圖；每一個故事、每一張照片、每一份文件，都會給你多一塊拼圖。",
