                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a child finishes school later than expected, misses the bus, or needs to contact their parents after an activity, having a phone can make life much easier and less stressful for everyone. A quick message can save a lot of worry.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果孩子放學比預期晚、錯過了巴士，或者課外活動之後需要聯絡父母，那麼有一部手機通常會令整件事方便得多，也讓所有人都少一點擔心。有時一個簡單訊息，就已經能省下很多焦慮。",
