                  "number": 1,
                  "sourceNumber": 5,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think giving a child a phone at that age should mean giving them unlimited freedom online.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我並不認為在那個年齡給孩子一部手機，就等於要給他們毫無限制的網上自由。",
