                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a wealthy business owner may be able to expand a company, hire top people, invest in new ideas, and build connections that give them even more influence. By contrast, someone with talent but very limited resources may have brilliant ideas, yet still struggle to turn them into reality.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位富有的企業老闆可能有能力擴展公司、聘請最優秀的人才、投資新想法，並建立更多能進一步提升自己影響力的人脈。相比之下，一個很有才華但資源有限的人，也許有很好的想法，卻仍然可能難以把它真正變成現實。",
