                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a respected teacher, a community leader, or even a grandparent in a family may not be wealthy at all, but their words can still carry great authority. People listen to them not because of what is in their wallet, but because of who they are and what they represent.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位受人尊敬的老師、一位社區領袖，甚至一位家中的祖父母，未必很有錢，但他們說的話仍然可能很有分量。人們願意聆聽他們，不是因為他們的錢包有多厚，而是因為他們是怎樣的人，以及他們所代表的是甚麼。",
