                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a child gets pocket money and wants a new toy, parents can encourage them to save a little each week instead of blowing it all at once. Through that process, the child learns patience, self-control, and the basic idea that money does not grow on trees.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子拿到零用錢後想買新玩具，父母就可以鼓勵他每星期儲起一部分，而不是一下子全花光。透過這個過程，孩子不但會學到耐性和自制力，也會慢慢明白一個很基本的道理：錢不是天上掉下來的。",
