                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think children should be taught about money in a way that makes them obsessed with it.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我並不認為教孩子金錢觀念就等於要讓他們對錢過分執著。",
