                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, parents can teach a child to divide their pocket money into three parts: some to spend, some to save, and some to give away. That kind of approach teaches not only financial sense, but also generosity and perspective.",
                  "textZh": "例如，父母可以教孩子把零用錢分成三部分：一部分用來花、一部分用來儲，還有一部分可以用來幫助別人。這樣的做法教到孩子的，不只是理財上的判斷力，還有慷慨和看事情的角度。",
