                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if there is a major conflict overseas, it may affect fuel prices, supply chains, or the cost of goods in local shops. In the same way, if another country introduces an important new policy or technology, that can also influence business, education, or public debate elsewhere. So foreign news may feel distant at first, but very often it travels closer than people think.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果海外出現重大衝突，它可能會影響燃料價格、供應鏈，甚至本地商店裡貨品的價格。同樣地，如果另一個國家推出重要的新政策或新科技，那也可能影響其他地方的商業、教育，或者公共討論。所以，外國新聞乍看之下也許很遙遠，但很多時候，它其實比人們想像中更快走到身邊。",
