                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "It may stop a child in the moment because of shock or fear, but that is not the same as real discipline. Real discipline is supposed to teach self-control, understanding, and better behaviour over time. Major child-health bodies say physical punishment does not improve behaviour in the long run and is linked to harms such as increased aggression, anxiety, and other negative outcomes.",
                  "textZh": "它也許會因為震懾或恐懼而令孩子當下停下來，但那並不等於真正的管教。真正的管教，應該是教會孩子自制、理解，以及長遠更好的行為。主要兒童健康機構都指出，體罰並不能在長遠上改善行為，反而和更高的攻擊性、焦慮，以及其他負面結果有關。",
