                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a child hits their sibling and an adult responds by slapping the child, the child may go quiet, but the lesson they may absorb is that the stronger person gets to use force. A calmer response, such as stopping the behaviour, explaining the rule, and giving a clear consequence, teaches far more.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子打了自己的兄弟姊妹，而大人回應的方法是打回那個孩子，那麼孩子也許會安靜下來，但他真正吸收到的訊息，很可能只是「比較強的人可以用暴力」。相反，如果大人冷靜地先制止行為，再清楚解釋規則，並給出明確後果，這樣其實能教得更多。",
