                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do think children need firm boundaries and real consequences; I just do not think violence should be one of them.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我的確認為孩子需要清楚的界線和真正的後果；我只是不認為暴力應該成為其中一種方法。",
