                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say hitting children is not necessary for discipline, and in most cases it is more harmful than helpful. Firm, calm, respectful discipline may take more patience, but it teaches the right lesson and leaves fewer scars, both seen and unseen.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說打孩子並不是管教所必需的，而且在大多數情況下，它帶來的傷害往往比幫助更多。堅定、冷靜而有尊重的管教，也許需要更多耐性，但它教的是正確的功課，而且留下的傷痕會少得多，無論是看得見的，還是看不見的。",
