                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I would not say sweets are the best reward overall, although a small treat once in a while is probably fine.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我不會說甜食是最好的獎勵方式，不過偶爾給一點小小的甜點，我覺得問題不大。",
