                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a child is told, “Finish your homework and I’ll give you chocolate,” they may do the task, of course, but they may also start expecting sugar every time they behave well. After a while, good behaviour is no longer its own reward; it comes with a price tag.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子被告訴：「做完功課就給你朱古力」，他當然可能會把事情做好；但同時，他也可能開始期待自己每次表現好時，都應該有甜食。久而久之，良好行為本身就不再是值得做的事，而像是附帶了一個標價。",
