                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a child has worked very hard for an exam or has shown real improvement in something difficult, giving them an ice cream once in a while is probably harmless. But I still think rewards like praise, extra playtime, a day out, or doing something fun together are healthier and often more meaningful in the long run.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子為考試真的很努力，或者在某件困難的事上有明顯進步，那麼偶爾獎勵他一杯雪糕，大概也沒甚麼大問題。不過，我仍然覺得，像稱讚、多一點玩樂時間、一次外出活動，或者一家人一起做些有趣的事，這些獎勵方式會更健康，而且從長遠來看，往往也更有意義。",
