                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, even a simple gathering at someone’s home can be memorable if the guests get along well, the conversation flows, and no one feels like a spare part in the room. Sometimes a small party with warmth has far more sparkle than a huge event with no soul.",
                  "textZh": "例如，即使只是一個在家裡舉行的簡單聚會，如果賓客相處融洽、談話自然流動，而且沒有人覺得自己像房間裡多出來的那一個，那個聚會都可以非常難忘。有時一個有溫度的小聚會，反而比一場沒有靈魂的大型活動更有光彩。",
