                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, practical details matter a great deal, because a good party also needs to run smoothly.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，實際安排也非常重要，因為一個好的派對同時也需要進行得順暢。",
