                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if the music is too loud, the food arrives too late, or the guests do not know each other and nobody helps them connect, the evening can become painfully awkward. By contrast, when the host introduces people well and keeps things flowing, the party usually finds its own rhythm.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果音樂太吵、食物太遲才到，或者賓客彼此不認識，而又沒有人幫忙打開話題，那個晚上就可能變得很尷尬。相反，當主人懂得替大家搭橋、讓整個流程自然推進時，派對通常就會慢慢找到自己的節奏。",
