                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think family parties are also organised out of tradition and a sense of respect, especially towards older family members.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也認為家庭聚會很多時是出於傳統，以及一種對長輩的尊重。",
