                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "To be honest, in many families, gathering is not just a personal choice; it is also part of family culture. Turning up for a reunion dinner, an elder’s birthday, or an important family event can be a way of showing that you still value the family bond. It is less about putting on a show and more about saying, without saying it directly, “You matter, and this family still matters.”",
                  "textZh": "老實說，在很多家庭裡，聚在一起不只是個人選擇，同時也是家庭文化的一部分。出席團年飯、長輩壽宴，或者一些重要家庭場合，很多時都是一種表達：你仍然重視這段家庭關係。這與其說是在做表面工夫，不如說是在用一種不必明講的方式表達：「你很重要，而這個家也仍然很重要。」",
