                  "number": 1,
                  "sourceNumber": 1,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, this is definitely true in Hong Kong, especially for occasions like weddings, milestone birthdays, baby full-month celebrations, or big family banquets. Personally, I think it can be a good thing in moderation, but it becomes a bad trend when people spend beyond their means.",
                  "textZh": "是的，這種情況在香港的確很常見，尤其是在婚禮、重要生日、嬰兒滿月酒，或者大型家庭宴會這些場合。就我個人而言，我認為適度地花錢可以是好事，但如果花到超出自己能力範圍，這就會變成一個不好的趨勢。",
