                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, this is certainly true in Hong Kong, and I can understand why people do it, because family celebrations often carry emotional and social weight at the same time.",
