                  "number": 1,
                  "sourceNumber": 5,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, if I had to choose, I would say it is more of a bad trend when the spending becomes excessive or competitive.",
                  "textZh": "不過，如果一定要選一邊，我會說，當花費變得過度，甚至帶有攀比意味時，這更像是一個壞趨勢。",
