                  "textEn": "The main reason is that happiness usually grows when it has somewhere to go. If something wonderful happens and you celebrate it with people who care about you, the whole moment feels warmer, fuller, and more alive. It is not just about the event itself; it is also about the feeling of being seen, supported, and celebrated by others. In that sense, joy often lands more deeply when it has company.",
