                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone graduates, gets engaged, or lands their dream job, they may of course feel happy on their own. But if they celebrate it with family or close friends, the memory often becomes much richer. Years later, people may forget the exact words, but they still remember the laughter, the faces, and the feeling in the room.",
