                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a person may decide whether to cook at home or eat out, whether to take the bus or a taxi, and whether to save money or buy something they want straight away. None of those choices sounds dramatic, but together they shape how the day unfolds.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人可能要決定是在家煮飯還是外出吃、坐巴士還是搭的士，以及把錢存起來還是立刻買下自己想要的東西。這些選擇單看都不算戲劇化，但加起來卻會決定整天是怎樣展開的。",
