                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone may come home tired and have to decide whether to snap at their family or calm themselves down first. Another person may see a friend struggling and decide whether to reach out or simply mind their own business. Those decisions may not appear on any to-do list, but they often say the most about a person’s character.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人下班回家很累時，可能就要決定自己是把情緒發洩在家人身上，還是先讓自己冷靜下來。另一個人看到朋友正處於困境時，也可能要決定自己是主動伸出援手，還是只顧好自己就算了。這些決定不會出現在任何待辦清單上，但它們很多時候最能反映一個人的品格。",
                  "pages": [
                    33
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    33,
                    33
                  ]
