                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say people generally make two kinds of decisions in daily life: practical ones and personal ones. The practical choices keep life moving, while the personal ones give that life its tone and texture.",
