                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, for everyday or low-stakes decisions, I’d say deciding alone is generally easier, simply because it saves time, energy, and unnecessary complication.",
                  "textZh": "所以，對於日常生活中那些不算太重大的決定，我會說自己作決定通常比較容易，因為那樣能節省時間、精力，也能避免不必要的複雜化。",
                  "pages": [
                    34
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    34,
                    34
                  ]
