                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if parents keep telling a teenager what subjects to choose, how to spend their free time, or which friends to avoid, the teenager may immediately become defensive. Even if the advice makes sense, they may reject it simply because they want the decision to feel like their own.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果父母不停告訴一個青少年應該選甚麼科目、怎樣運用空閒時間，或者應該避開哪些朋友，那個青少年很可能立刻進入防禦狀態。即使那些建議本身有道理，他也可能只是因為想讓決定感覺是自己作出的，而直接把它推開。",
                  "pages": [
                    36
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    36,
                    36
                  ]
