                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a young person wants to pursue a newer kind of career, such as content creation, design, or something in the digital world, their parents may push them towards a more traditional path. The parents may be speaking from caution and love, but the young person may hear only doubt and disbelief. That gap in perspective can make advice feel more like a wall than a bridge.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個年輕人想走一條較新的職業路，例如內容創作、設計，或者一些數碼世界裡的工作，父母卻可能會把他推向較傳統的路。父母的出發點也許是出於謹慎和愛，但年輕人聽進去的卻可能只有懷疑和不被相信。這種視角上的落差，會令建議更像一道牆，而不是一座橋。",
                  "pages": [
                    37
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    37,
                    37
                  ]
