                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say many young people are unwilling to listen to their parents’ advice because of a mix of pride, independence, and generational distance. In other words，good advice is not only about being right; it is also about being heard.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說很多年輕人不願意聽父母的建議，是因為自尊、獨立意識，以及世代距離交織在一起。好的建議不只是要說得對，也要真正能被聽進去。",
