                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, definitely. I do think adults can have a lot of imagination; it is just that their imagination often looks different from a child’s.",
                  "textZh": "是的，絕對可以。我確實認為成年人可以有很多想像力，只不過他們的想像力很多時看起來和小孩子的不太一樣。",
