                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, I would say adults can absolutely be highly imaginative, because imagination is not only for play; it is also a tool for creating, solving, and shaping life.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我會說成年人絕對可以非常有想像力，因為想像力不只是用來玩樂的；它同時也是一種用來創造、解決問題，以及塑造生活的能力。",
