                  "sourceNumber": 5,
                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I also think many adults seem less imaginative, not because they lack imagination, but because routine and pressure can push it into the background.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也認為很多成年人看起來好像沒那麼有想像力，但那並不是因為他們真的缺乏想像力，而是因為日常規律和壓力把它推到了背景裡。",
                  "pages": [
                    45
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    45,
                    45
                  ]
