                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think adults can have a great deal of imagination, although it may be quieter and less obvious than it is in childhood. Childlike imagination may dance in the open, while adult imagination often works behind the scenes, but both are real, and both can be powerful.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為成年人完全可以有很豐富的想像力，只不過它未必像童年時那樣明顯、那樣張揚。孩子的想像力也許是在陽光下跳舞，而成年人的想像力很多時則是在幕後運作；不過，兩者都是真實的，而且兩者都可以很有力量。",
