                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, I would definitely say imagination is necessary for scientists, because it helps them see beyond what is already known and push the boundaries of understanding.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我絕對會說想像力對科學家來說是必要的，因為它能幫助他們看見已知以外的東西，並把人類理解的邊界推得更遠。",
