                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, someone may strongly oppose a certain lifestyle, career path, or social issue when they are young, but after working in the real world or hearing other people’s stories, they may realise the situation is more complicated than they first thought.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人年輕時可能會很強烈地反對某種生活方式、職業道路，或者社會議題；但當他真正進入社會工作，或者聽到別人的故事之後，他就可能會發現，事情其實比他原本以為的複雜得多。",
