                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if the government changes transport fares, public services, or education policy, ordinary people are very likely to talk about it with friends, family members, or colleagues. Even people who do not usually follow politics closely may suddenly have a lot to say when the issue touches their wallet or their future.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果政府調整交通費、公營服務，或者教育政策，一般人很可能都會和朋友、家人，或者同事談論這些事情。即使平時不算特別關心政治的人，一旦事情牽涉到自己的荷包或未來，也往往會突然間有很多意見。",
