                  "textEn": "So yes, I would say a lot of people do like expressing political opinions, particularly when the topic strikes a nerve or feels personally relevant.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我會說很多人確實喜歡表達政治意見，特別是當話題觸動他們，或者和自身利益密切相關的時候。",
                  "pages": [
                    62
                  ],
