                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, not everyone enjoys talking about politics, because it can be divisive, exhausting, and sometimes a bit of a minefield.",
                  "textZh": "不過，並不是每個人都喜歡談政治，因為政治有時很容易令人對立、感到疲累，而且某程度上也像一個地雷區。",
