                  "textEn": "That said, people also need to wait in less visible ways, especially when they are waiting for an outcome rather than standing in a physical queue.",
                  "textZh": "不過，人們也會以另一種較不明顯的方式去等候，特別是當他們等的是一個結果，而不是實際站在隊伍裡的時候。",
                  "pages": [
                    66
                  ],
