                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a website loads slowly, if a queue moves too little, or if someone does not reply to a message quickly, many people become irritated almost at once. In the past, they might have shrugged it off, but now their patience can wear thin very quickly.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果網站開得慢一點、排隊前進得太慢，或者別人沒有很快回覆訊息，很多人往往幾乎立刻就會感到煩躁。放在以前，他們也許只是聳聳肩就算了；但現在，耐性往往一下子就被磨薄了。",
