                  "textEn": "For instance, people today often have to deal with long working hours, career pressure, financial stress, and complicated personal lives. Those things can make them emotionally tougher, even if they are less patient with small everyday inconveniences. In other words, many people have become less patient with slow service, but perhaps more patient with life’s heavier burdens. So the picture is not entirely black and white.",
