                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people today are probably less patient with speed, delay, and everyday frustration than people in the past. However, that does not necessarily mean they are weaker; it may simply mean that modern life has shortened their fuse in some areas while hardening them in others.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，和過去相比，現在的人大概在面對速度、延遲，以及日常瑣碎挫折時，的確比較沒有耐性。不過，這未必代表他們比較脆弱；更可能只是現代生活在某些方面縮短了他們的耐性，同時又在另一些方面把他們磨得更堅韌。",
