                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if commuters waste hours every week waiting for delayed transport, or if citizens have to wait months for basic services, the result is not patience but frustration. In that case, waiting stops being a social virtue and starts becoming a social burden.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果上班族每星期都因交通延誤而白白浪費好幾小時，或者市民要等上幾個月才能得到基本服務，最後產生的就不會是耐性，而是挫敗感。在那種情況下，等待就不再是一種社會美德，而開始變成社會負擔。",
