                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if I am working on something difficult, such as learning a new skill or dealing with a slow group project, I usually try to stay calm and take it step by step instead of getting frustrated straight away. The same applies when I am talking to children or older people. I tend to listen first rather than cut in impatiently.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果我正在處理一件比較困難的事情，例如學習一項新技能，或者面對一個進度很慢的小組項目，我通常都會先讓自己冷靜下來，一步一步去做，而不是立刻變得很煩躁。同樣地，當我和小朋友或長者相處時，我也通常會先聽對方說，而不是不耐煩地打斷。",
