                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "To be honest, my patience can wear thin when people are repeatedly careless, rude, or unwilling to take responsibility for things they should clearly handle themselves. Everyone has a limit, and I’m no exception. If the same problem keeps happening again and again, or if someone wastes other people’s time without a good reason, I can start to feel that my patience is being tested.",
