                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "To some extent, yes, I do agree that impatience can help the development of technology.",
                  "textZh": "某程度上，是的，我的確認為不耐煩可以推動科技發展。",
