                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, people did not want to queue at banks, so online banking and digital payments became more important. In the same way, people hated waiting for taxis or takeaways, so apps were developed to make those services faster and easier. A lot of useful technology is really built on the simple human desire to save time and effort.",
                  "textZh": "例如，人們不想在銀行排長龍，所以網上銀行和電子支付就變得愈來愈重要。同樣地，人們討厭等的士，也不想苦苦等外賣，所以各種應用程式就被發展出來，令這些服務更快、更方便。很多有用的科技，其實正正是建立在人類想節省時間和力氣這種很直接的渴望之上的。",
