                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a company releases a new app, device, or AI tool too quickly, it may be full of bugs, invade people’s privacy, or create problems nobody thought through properly. In serious areas such as medicine or transport, rushing technology can be especially risky.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一家公司太快推出新的應用程式、裝置，或者人工智能工具，那它就可能充滿漏洞、侵犯私隱，或者製造出一些根本沒有被好好思考過的問題。在醫療或交通這些較嚴肅的範疇裡，過於倉促地發展科技，風險尤其大。",
