                  "textEn": "The main reason is that good advice is not just about sounding wise; it has to fit the person as well. People who know me well understand my personality, my habits, and even my blind spots. So when I am confused, they can often tell whether I am overthinking, being too emotional, or missing something obvious. In that sense, good advice often begins with good understanding.",
