                  "textEn": "So, in my view, parents should try to turn mistakes into learning moments, because the goal is not just to stop the behaviour, but to help the child grow beyond it.",
                  "textZh": "所以，在我看來，父母應該盡量把錯誤變成學習時刻，因為真正的目的不只是阻止某個行為，而是幫助孩子從中成長。",
