                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, being understanding does not mean letting children off the hook, because mistakes still need consequences and responsibility.",
                  "textZh": "不過，願意理解孩子，並不代表要輕輕放過，因為錯誤仍然需要有後果，也需要承擔責任。",
