                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a child breaks something through carelessness, the parent might ask them to apologise, help clean it up, or use some pocket money to replace it. That way, the child learns accountability, but still feels supported rather than shamed.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個孩子因為粗心而弄壞了東西，父母可以要求他道歉、一起收拾善後，或者用部分零用錢去補償。這樣一來，孩子就能學會承擔責任，但同時仍然感受到自己是被支持的，而不是被羞辱的。",
