                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, highly detailed plans do have their place, especially when the task is important, complex, or time-sensitive.",
                  "textZh": "不過，非常詳細的計劃也確實有它的用處，尤其是當事情本身很重要、很複雜，或者時間性很強的時候。",
                  "pages": [
                    109
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    109,
                    109
                  ]
