                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think people who are organised, responsible, and goal-oriented are usually the ones who like to make plans.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，那些有條理、有責任感，而且很有目標感的人，通常都比較喜歡做計劃。",
