                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that planning gives them a sense of direction and control. They do not like leaving everything to chance, especially if they have a lot on their plate. For that kind of person, a plan is not just a schedule; it is a map. It helps them see what needs to be done, when it should be done, and how to avoid things falling through the cracks.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，計劃能給他們一種方向感和掌控感。他們不喜歡把一切都交給運氣，尤其是當自己手頭上本來就有很多事情要處理的時候。對這類人來說，計劃不只是一張時間表，而更像是一張地圖。它能幫助他們看清楚甚麼事情要做、甚麼時候做，以及怎樣避免事情從手縫裡溜走。",
