                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, it is not only highly organised people who like planning; sometimes anxious or cautious people do too.",
                  "textZh": "不過，喜歡做計劃的人不一定只有那些特別有條理的人；有時候，較焦慮或較謹慎的人也一樣會很喜歡。",
