                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, before a trip, one person may simply pack a bag and go, whereas another may prepare a full itinerary, check transport options, book everything in advance, and even make a backup plan. The second type is often someone who feels better when life has a blueprint.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在旅行之前，有些人可能只是隨便收拾一下就出發；但另一些人則會先做好完整行程、查清交通安排、提早訂好所有東西，甚至連後備方案都準備好。第二種人很多時就是那種只要人生有藍圖，心裡就會更踏實的人。",
