                  "textEn": "In most cases, people do not just wake up one day and magically know the answer. They usually think about their strengths, school results, interests, and job prospects, and then try to connect the dots. Some may aim for a stable career, while others may care more about passion or personal growth. So planning often begins with a rough picture rather than a perfect map.",
