                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think most people plan everything in a rigid way, because real life has a habit of changing the script.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不覺得大多數人會用一種很僵硬的方式把一切都規劃好，因為現實生活往往很喜歡臨時改劇本。",
