                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think one major reason is that imported products are often seen as better in quality, or at least more trustworthy.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，其中一個主要原因是，進口產品往往會被看成品質較好，或者至少更值得信任。",
