                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in Hong Kong, some people prefer imported skincare, baby products, or food items because they believe those products are safer or more refined. Even if a local version is available, they may still lean towards the imported one because it gives them more confidence.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在香港，有些人會特別偏好進口護膚品、嬰兒用品，或者食品，因為他們相信這些產品較安全，或者整體質感更精緻。即使本地也有類似產品，他們仍然可能會傾向選擇進口貨，因為那會讓他們更有信心。",
