                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone may buy imported chocolate or coffee not because local options are bad, but because the imported version feels a little more distinctive or indulgent. It is a bit like choosing a song with a different accent: the melody may be similar, but the flavour feels new.",
                  "textZh": "例如，有些人會購買進口朱古力或咖啡，不是因為本地選擇不好，而是因為進口版本讓人感覺較有特色，或者較有一點犒賞自己的意味。這有點像選一首帶著不同口音的歌：旋律也許相近，但味道就是更新鮮。",
