                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say people like to buy imported products because they often see them as more reliable, more attractive, or simply more interesting. Sometimes it is about quality, and sometimes it is about identity. Either way, imported products often offer people not just utility, but a certain feeling as well.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，人們喜歡購買進口產品，是因為他們很多時會把它們看成更可靠、更吸引，或者單純更有趣。有時那關乎品質，有時則關乎身份認同。無論如何，進口產品帶給人的，很多時候不只是實用性，還有某種感覺。",
