                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a student or young professional living alone may feel that cooking one small meal is too much fuss. They may think, “Why spend an hour cooking and cleaning when I can get something delivered in twenty minutes?” Once that habit sets in, it can be hard to break.",
