                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "One meal by itself may not seem too bad, but when people buy breakfast, lunch, coffee, snacks, and dinner outside all the time, the cost starts to snowball. That is when eating out really begins to eat into your budget. In other words, it is not always the single meal that hurts; sometimes it is the pattern behind it.",
