                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, an office worker might think a takeaway lunch is perfectly reasonable, but if they also buy coffee in the morning and dinner on the way home, by the end of the month they may realise they have spent a lot more than expected.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位上班族可能會覺得買一個外賣午餐完全合理，但如果他早上還買咖啡，下班回家路上又順便買晚餐，到月底時，他就可能會發現自己其實花得比想像中多很多。",
