                  "textEn": "I think it is mainly because people have different interests, priorities, and personalities, so naturally they are drawn to different kinds of magazines.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，主要原因是每個人的興趣、重視的事情，以及個性都不同，所以他們自然會被不同類型的雜誌吸引。",
