                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "Some people read magazines for information, some for inspiration, and some simply to switch off and relax. A person who is interested in finance may want to read about markets and business trends, whereas someone else may be more interested in fashion, travel, sport, or entertainment. In other words, magazines are not a one-size-fits-all kind of thing. People usually choose the ones that speak to their own tastes and needs.",
