                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "What catches your eye at one stage of life may not interest you much at another. Teenagers may be drawn to pop culture and celebrity stories, adults may prefer career, health, or parenting content, and older readers may enjoy magazines about travel, gardening, or current affairs. Lifestyle plays a part as well. People often read magazines that reflect the life they are living, or the life they aspire to. So, in a way, the choice of magazine can act like a small mirror: it reflects what matters to a person at that moment.",
