                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if there is a major political event or a natural disaster, TV can show the scene almost immediately and let viewers feel the urgency of the moment. A magazine article about the same event would probably come later, but it might explain the causes, the wider context, and the long-term impact in a much fuller way.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果發生一件重大的政治事件，或者一場天然災害，電視可以幾乎即時把現場畫面呈現出來，讓觀眾直接感受到事情的迫切性。而同一件事如果由雜誌去報道，雖然出來得比較後，但它往往能更完整地解釋事件的成因、更大的背景，以及長遠影響。",
