                  "textEn": "So, overall, I would say TV is better for speed and impact, while magazines are better for depth and understanding.",
                  "textZh": "所以，整體來說，我會說電視在速度和衝擊力方面更有優勢，而雜誌則在深度和理解方面更強。",
