                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone watching the evening news may get a broad overview of several topics in just a few minutes, but a person reading a magazine feature on science, culture, or business may come away with a deeper and more layered understanding of one subject.",
