                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think we have rules in society mainly because people need order, boundaries, and protection in order to live together peacefully.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，社會之所以需要規則，主要是因為人們要和平地一起生活，就必須有秩序、有界線，也有保障。",
