                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say yes, rules about overworking are necessary, but they need to be fair, realistic, and well-designed. Good rules should protect workers without tying every workplace in knots.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，是的，防止過度工作的規則是有必要的，但它們必須公平、實際，而且設計得好。好的規則應該保護員工，同時又不至於把每一個工作場所都綁得死死的。",
