                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the classrooms of the near future will probably become more digital, more flexible, and more focused on real understanding than mechanical learning. The tools may change quickly, of course, but I think the deeper goal will be the same: helping students become not just better test-takers, but better thinkers.",
