                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "A good student should be open-minded enough to listen to different views, humble enough to accept feedback, and resilient enough to recover from setbacks. After all, university life is rarely a smooth ride. There will be pressure, disappointment, and the occasional reality check. What really sets a good student apart is not whether they never stumble, but whether they can get back on their feet and keep moving forward.",
