                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if a student fails a test or struggles in a group project, a mature response would be to reflect on what went wrong, improve their approach, and try again, rather than blaming everyone else or giving up. That kind of resilience says a lot about their character.",
