                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, one very effective way to build independence is to let children do more for themselves, even if it takes a little longer or looks a little messy at first.",
                  "textZh": "所以，要培養孩子的獨立性，其中一個很有效的方法，就是讓他們多為自己做一些事，即使一開始比較慢，或者看起來有點亂。",
                  "pages": [
                    24
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    24,
                    24
                  ]
