                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say children become more independent when adults give them responsibility, decision-making space, and the chance to learn by doing. Independence is not built by keeping children in a bubble; it is built by letting them stretch their wings, little by little.",
