                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think if parents interfere too much, one of the biggest effects is that children may grow up less confident and less independent.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，如果父母干涉得太多，其中一個最大的影響，就是孩子長大後可能會變得較沒有自信，也較不獨立。",
