                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if parents check every message, question every friendship, and comment on every choice, a teenager may stop sharing what they really think. They may smile on the surface, but emotionally, they start shutting the door.",
