                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say advertising has a strong influence on the way people shop, especially by shaping desire and directing attention. However, advertising is more like a powerful push than a string that can control people at will; it may bring people to the door, but when it comes to actually paying, reality usually has the final say.",
