                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone is in a restaurant and the staff are rude or the order is wrong, they may politely call the waiter over, explain the problem, and ask for it to be corrected. If the staff handle it well, the customer may calm down quite quickly.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人在餐廳裡遇到店員態度差，或者送錯餐點，他可能就會有禮貌地叫侍應過來，說明問題，並要求對方改正。如果店員處理得好，客人其實通常也很快會冷靜下來。",
