                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in a very crowded city, people may have to live in smaller flats, spend longer commuting, and wait much longer for medical appointments or public housing. Even everyday life can start to feel like a constant squeeze.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在一個非常擠迫的城市裡，人們可能要住在更小的單位裡、花更長時間通勤，也要等更久才能輪到醫療服務或公共房屋。到了那個地步，就連日常生活也可能開始變成一種持續不斷的擠壓感。",
                  "pages": [
                    68
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    68,
                    68
                  ]
