                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that poverty is not just about having less money; it is often about being trapped in a cycle of pressure and insecurity. If people are constantly worrying about rent, bills, or their next meal, it becomes extremely hard for them to plan ahead or improve their situation. In that sense, basic support is not a luxury; it is the floor that stops people from falling through the cracks.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，貧窮不只是「錢比較少」那麼簡單；很多時候，它其實是一種被困在壓力和不安全感之中的循環。如果一個人每天都在擔心租金、帳單，或者下一餐在哪裡，那他就很難談得上規劃未來，或者改善自己的處境。從這個角度來說，基本支援並不是奢侈品，而是一塊地板，防止人直接跌進裂縫裡。",
                  "pages": [
                    70
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    70,
                    70
                  ]
