                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think financial support alone is enough, because the long-term answer lies in education, job opportunities, and fair wages.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為單靠經濟援助就已經足夠，因為長遠的答案其實在於教育、工作機會，以及合理工資。",
                  "pages": [
                    71
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    71,
                    71
                  ]
