                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think poverty can only be alleviated properly when society tackles both the symptoms and the roots of the problem. People need immediate support to survive, but they also need real opportunities to stand on their own two feet.",
