                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the difference between major and minor crime lies mainly in the level of harm, danger, and punishment, but it is not always as clean-cut as it sounds. The legal label matters, but the human impact matters too.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說重大罪行和輕微罪行的分別主要在於傷害程度、危險性，以及懲罰輕重，但事情未必總像表面說起來那麼一刀兩斷。法律上的分類固然重要，但對人的實際影響同樣重要。",
                  "pages": [
                    74
                  ],
