                  "textEn": "For instance, I have seen older people use messaging apps or video calls very confidently once someone has shown them patiently. On the other hand, even some young people get lost when a badly designed system is clumsy or unclear. So age matters, but usability matters too.",
                  "textZh": "例如，我見過一些長者在有人耐心教過之後，會很有信心地使用通訊軟件或視像通話。另一方面，即使是一些年輕人，面對設計得很差、操作又混亂的系統時，也同樣會一頭霧水。所以，年齡固然有影響，但易用性也同樣重要。",
