                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say older people do tend to have more difficulty using some things, especially modern technology, but that is not because they are inherently less able. Very often, it is a matter of exposure, support, and whether the world has been designed with them in mind.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說長者的確傾向在使用某些東西時遇到更多困難，尤其是在現代科技方面，但那並不是因為他們天生比較差。很多時候，問題其實在於接觸機會、支援是否足夠，以及這個世界在設計時有沒有把他們也放在考慮之中。",
