                  "textEn": "Ageing is not one-size-fits-all. Some older people are very energetic, while others may have joint problems, heart issues, or simply lower stamina. So the key is not to chase intensity for its own sake, but to choose exercise that is safe, suitable, and sustainable. In other words, it is better to move wisely than to push recklessly.",
