                  "textEn": "I think one common reason is simply that not everyone is genuinely interested in sport, so the Olympic Games may not hold much appeal for them in the first place.",
                  "textZh": "我認為其中一個很常見的原因，其實很簡單：並不是每個人都真心對運動有興趣，所以奧運本身對他們來說，一開始就未必有很大吸引力。",
