                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "Another reason is that the Olympic Games can feel too long, too crowded, or even a little overhyped for some viewers.",
                  "textZh": "另一個原因是，對某些觀眾來說，奧運會可能顯得太長、太多項目，甚至有點被炒作得過了火。",
