                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a person may enjoy watching one football match or one tennis final, but feel no desire to sit through two weeks of endless highlights, medal tables, interviews, and ceremonies. For them, the Olympics may feel less like a celebration and more like too much of a good thing.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人可能很喜歡看一場足球賽，或者一場網球決賽，但對於連續兩星期不停看精華片段、獎牌榜、訪問和各種儀式，卻完全沒有興趣。對這種人來說，奧運與其說像一場慶典，不如說更像是好東西放得太多，反而失去了吸引力。",
