                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say somebody might dislike watching the Olympic Games because they are not interested in sport to begin with, or because the event feels too big and too intense. For some people, the Olympics are inspiring; for others, they are simply too much noise and not enough connection.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，有些人不喜歡看奧運，可能是因為他們本來就對運動沒甚麼興趣，也可能是因為整個活動讓人覺得太龐大、太密集。對某些人來說，奧運很鼓舞人心；但對另一些人來說，它只是太多聲音，卻沒有足夠的連結感。",
