                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Personally, I think an athlete should have much more than natural talent. Above all, they need discipline, resilience, and a strong work ethic.",
                  "textZh": "就我個人而言，我認為一位運動員需要的，遠遠不只是天分。最重要的是，他們要有紀律、韌性，以及很強的做事態度。",
