                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think a good athlete should also be focused, humble, and able to work well with other people.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也認為，一位好的運動員還應該具備專注、謙遜，以及和別人好好合作的能力。",
