                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a talented football player may score a lot of goals, but if they refuse to listen to the coach, blame teammates, or lose their temper whenever things go wrong, they will not be admired for long. By contrast, an athlete who stays calm, keeps learning, and supports the team often earns much deeper respect.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一位很有天分的足球員也許能進很多球，但如果他不肯聽教練意見、把責任推給隊友，或者一出問題就發脾氣，那麼別人對他的欣賞通常不會維持太久。相反，一位能保持冷靜、持續學習，而且願意支持團隊的運動員，往往更能贏得深一層的尊重。",
