                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a student who knows how to research a topic, compare different sources, and break a difficult task into smaller parts will usually cope much better than someone who only waits to be told exactly what to do. That kind of student can grow in almost any subject.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個懂得如何查找資料、比較不同來源，並把困難任務拆成較小步驟的學生，通常都會比一個只會等別人告訴自己下一步該做甚麼的人應付得更好。這種學生幾乎在任何科目上都更容易成長。",
