                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, students also need to master people skills and self-management skills, such as communication, teamwork, and time management.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，學生也需要掌握與人相處和自我管理的技能，例如溝通、團隊合作，以及時間管理。",
