                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "To be honest, school is not only about passing exams. In real life, students need to express themselves clearly, listen to others properly, work with different personalities, and manage pressure without falling to pieces. A sharp mind is valuable, of course, but even a bright student can stumble if they cannot organise their time or get along with other people. In other words, success depends not only on what students know, but also on how they handle themselves and those around them.",
