                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, in a group project, a student may have good ideas, but if they cannot explain them clearly or cooperate with teammates, the whole project can suffer. Likewise, a student who never manages their schedule properly may always end up rushing at the last minute, no matter how intelligent they are.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在小組作業裡，一個學生也許很有想法，但如果他無法清楚表達，或者不能和隊友合作，整個項目都可能受影響。同樣地，一個從來不懂好好安排時間的學生，不管多聰明，最後也很可能總是臨急臨忙地趕工。",
