                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So yes, I would say learning new skills is often hard at first, because students need time to build confidence as well as ability.",
                  "textZh": "所以，是的，我會說學習新技能在一開始通常是困難的，因為學生不只是需要建立能力，同時也需要建立信心。",
