                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I think it is hard for students to learn new skills, but that kind of difficulty is often necessary and even helpful. What really matters is not how hard it feels at the beginning, but whether students are given the chance to turn awkward first steps into real ability over time.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我認為學生學習新技能的確會有難度，但那種難度很多時是必要的，甚至是有幫助的。真正重要的，不是一開始有多難，而是學生有沒有機會在跌跌撞撞之中，慢慢把不會變成會。",
