                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I’d say yes, it can be harder for older people to learn new skills, but harder does not mean impossible.",
                  "textZh": "我會說，是的，對年長的人來說，學習新技能的確可能比較困難；但比較困難並不等於不可能。",
