                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if an older person is trying to learn how to use a smartphone app, online banking, or a new computer system, they may need more time than a teenager would. Not necessarily because they are less intelligent, but because the whole environment feels less familiar to them.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一位年長者正在學習怎樣使用手機應用程式、網上銀行，或者新的電腦系統，他可能會比青少年花更多時間。這未必是因為他不夠聰明，而更多是因為整個使用環境對他來說沒有那麼熟悉。",
                  "pages": [
                    62
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    62,
                    62
                  ]
