                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone wants to improve their English speaking, studying hard for one night will not do very much. But if they practise a little every day, listen carefully, speak often, and keep using the language, their fluency will gradually become stronger and more natural.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人想提升英文口說能力，只靠某一晚突然很努力地讀，其實不會有太大作用。但如果他每天都練一點、仔細聽、多開口，而且不斷把語言用出來，那麼他的流利度就會慢慢變得更穩、更自然。",
