                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, for me, the foundation of any skill is steady practice, because talent may open the door, but repetition is what keeps you moving forward.",
                  "textZh": "所以，對我來說，任何技能的根基都是穩定的練習，因為天分也許能替你開門，但真正讓你一路走下去的，還是重複和累積。",
