                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, practice alone is not enough; good feedback, patience, and the willingness to make mistakes matter just as much.",
                  "textZh": "不過，單靠練習也不夠；好的回饋、耐性，以及願意犯錯的心態，同樣重要。",
