                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 7,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if someone is learning tennis, it is not enough just to hit the ball again and again. They need someone to point out their grip, timing, or footwork, and they also need the patience to accept that they will not look graceful straight away. The same goes for almost any skill, really.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人在學網球，光是不停揮拍擊球其實並不夠。他需要有人指出他的握拍、時機，或者步法出了甚麼問題，同時也要有耐性接受自己一開始不會打得很好看。其實，幾乎所有技能都是一樣的。",
