                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say what is necessary to learn and improve a skill is consistent practice, useful feedback, patience, and persistence. Skill does not bloom overnight; it grows when people are willing to repeat, reflect, and refine.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，學習並提升一項技能所需要的，是持續練習、有用的回饋、耐性，以及堅持。技能不會一夜之間開花；它是在一個人願意不斷重複、反思，並慢慢打磨時，才真正長出來的。",
