                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say photos are usually better for helping people remember quickly and vividly, while words are better for helping them understand and remember more deeply. So, if I had to give a balanced answer, I’d say photos catch the memory, but words anchor it.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說照片通常更能幫助人快速而鮮明地記住東西，而文字則更能幫助人深入理解，並且把記憶留得更穩。所以，如果要我給一個比較平衡的答案，我會說：照片能抓住記憶，但文字能把記憶固定下來。",
