                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "Yes, I think it can, because technology can act like an external memory system that helps people keep track of important information.",
                  "textZh": "是的，我認為可以，因為科技可以像一套外置記憶系統一樣，幫助人們記住重要資訊。",
