                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that modern technology makes it much easier to store, organise, and retrieve information. People can set reminders, save notes, record voice messages, use calendars, and even take photos of things they do not want to forget. In that sense, technology is a bit like tying a string around your finger, only in a much smarter form. It stops important details from slipping through the cracks.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，現代科技令儲存、整理，以及重新找回資訊這件事變得容易得多。人們可以設定提醒、儲存筆記、錄下語音訊息、使用行事曆，甚至把不想忘記的東西拍下來。從這個角度來看，科技有點像在手指上綁一條提醒自己的線，只不過它聰明得多。它能避免重要細節不知不覺從縫隙中溜走。",
