                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, a person might set a reminder for a doctor’s appointment, save a shopping list on their phone, or use a flashcard app to revise vocabulary. A student can also record a lecture or type notes during class, then go back to them later instead of relying on memory alone.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個人可以為看醫生設定提醒、把購物清單存在手機裡，或者用抽認卡應用程式溫習詞彙。學生也可以在上課時錄音，或者打筆記，之後再回去複習，而不只是單靠腦袋記住所有內容。",
