                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "That said, I do not think technology always improves memory in a healthy way, because people can become too dependent on it.",
                  "textZh": "不過，我也不認為科技在所有情況下都能以健康的方式提升記憶，因為人們也可能會對它產生過度依賴。",
