                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, many people no longer remember their friends’ phone numbers because everything is stored in their contacts. In the same way, a student who only takes screenshots of notes but never reviews them may feel organised, but may not actually remember much at all.",
                  "textZh": "例如，很多人現在已經記不起朋友的電話號碼，因為所有資料都存在聯絡人清單裡。同樣地，一個學生如果只是把筆記截圖存起來，卻從來不真正複習，那他表面上看起來很有條理，但實際上未必真的記得多少。",
