                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "To me, real communication also includes listening well, reading the situation, and knowing how to adjust your message for different people. Sometimes the most effective communicator is not the loudest person in the room, but the one who knows when to speak, when to pause, and how to make other people feel understood. In other words, communication is part clarity, part empathy, and part judgment.",
                  "textZh": "對我來說，真正的溝通同時也包括懂得聆聽、懂得看情況，以及知道怎樣因應不同的人去調整自己的表達。有時候，房間裡最有效的溝通者並不是聲音最大的人，而是那個知道甚麼時候該開口、甚麼時候該停下來，以及怎樣讓別人感到自己被理解的人。換句話說，溝通其實一部分是清晰，一部分是同理心，另一部分則是判斷力。",
