                  "textEn": "These skills are difficult because progress is often slow, uneven, and sometimes almost invisible. At the beginning, people are usually excited, but after that comes the long middle part, where improvement feels painfully gradual. That is where many people hit a wall. The problem is not always ability; very often, it is patience. Skills like these are built brick by brick, not in one dramatic leap.",
