                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, someone learning English may feel stuck for months even though they are improving bit by bit, and a beginner learning the piano may repeat the same piece again and again before it finally sounds smooth. In both cases, the skill becomes difficult not because it is impossible, but because it asks for consistency long after the first excitement has faded.",
