                  "sourceNumber": 6,
                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "A classroom cannot run well if the teacher is only a friendly presence and never sets standards. Students need encouragement, but they also need boundaries, discipline, and honest feedback. In other words, a teacher should not be a dictator, but nor should they fade into the background. They need to hold the room together and keep learning on track.",
                  "textZh": "如果老師只是很友善地陪伴，卻從來不設下標準，那課堂其實很難運作得好。學生需要鼓勵，但同時也需要界線、紀律，以及誠實的回饋。換句話說，老師不應該是個獨裁者，但也不應該退到背景裡變得毫無存在感。他必須把整個課堂穩住，並讓學習保持在正軌上。",
                  "pages": [
                    9
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    9,
                    9
                  ]
