                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say a teacher should be a guide, an organiser, and a steady presence in the classroom. In the end, the best teachers do not simply fill students’ heads with information; they bring out the best in them while still keeping the class grounded, focused, and moving forward.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說老師在課堂上應該是引導者、組織者，以及一種穩定的存在。說到底，最好的老師不只是把資訊塞進學生腦袋裡；他們更會在讓學生發揮最好一面的同時，仍然把整個課堂穩穩地放在正軌上，專注地向前推進。",
