                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 4,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, for me, clarity matters enormously, because a teacher who can explain well can turn confusion into confidence.",
                  "textZh": "所以，對我來說，清晰的講解能力非常重要，因為一位能把內容講得好的人，真的可以把迷惘變成自信。",
