                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I would say a good teacher should be clear, patient, and genuinely invested in students’ growth. Subject knowledge is important, of course, but what really sets a great teacher apart is the ability to reach students’ minds without losing their hearts.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說一位好老師應該講解清楚、有耐性，而且真心關心學生的成長。學科知識當然重要，但真正把好老師和普通老師分開的，往往是那種既能走進學生腦袋，也不會失去學生內心的能力。",
