          "index": 6,
          "title": "Do you think computers will one day replace teachers in the classroom?",
          "titleZh": "你認為將來電腦有一天會在課堂上取代老師嗎？",
          "cueText": "Do you think computers will one day replace teachers in the classroom?\n你認為將來電腦有一天會在課堂上取代老師嗎？",
