                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that teaching is not just about passing on information. A good teacher reads the room, notices confusion, senses boredom, encourages shy students, and changes their approach when something is not working. A computer can deliver content, but a teacher gives that content direction, warmth, and a human face. In that sense, a teacher is not just a source of knowledge, but a guide through it.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，教學並不只是把資訊傳遞出去而已。一位好的老師會看懂整個課堂的氣氛、留意到學生的困惑、察覺到沉悶感、鼓勵害羞的學生，並且在某種方法行不通時即時改變做法。電腦可以傳送內容，但老師會替那些內容加上方向、溫度，以及人的面貌。從這個角度來說，老師不只是知識的來源，更是帶領學生走過知識的人。",
                  "pages": [
                    14
                  ],
                  "pageRange": [
                    14,
                    14
                  ]
