                  "number": 3,
                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if a student looks lost during a lesson, a teacher may pause, explain the idea in simpler words, or use a completely different example on the spot. If a child is anxious, distracted, or lacking confidence, a teacher may notice that too. A machine may give the right answer, but it cannot always reach the student behind the question.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個學生在課堂上看起來一臉茫然，老師可能會立刻停下來，用更簡單的方式重新解釋，或者當場換一個完全不同的例子。如果一個孩子焦慮、分心，或者缺乏自信，老師也可能察覺得到。機器也許能給出正確答案，但它未必總能觸及那個提問背後真正的學生。",
