                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "So, overall, I would say computers may become excellent teaching tools, but they are unlikely to replace teachers completely.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說電腦也許會成為非常出色的教學工具，但它們不太可能完全取代老師。",
