                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "Computers are very good at speed, repetition, and adaptation. They can give instant feedback, provide extra exercises, track progress, and adjust the level to suit different students. In that sense, they can take a lot of weight off teachers’ shoulders and make learning more efficient. So the future may not be teacher or computer, but teacher and computer working hand in hand.",
                  "textZh": "電腦在速度、重複操練，以及調整內容方面其實非常強。它們可以即時提供回饋、給予額外練習、追蹤進度，並且按不同學生的程度調整難度。從這個角度來說，它們的確可以替老師分擔不少負擔，也讓學習變得更有效率。所以，未來與其說是老師或電腦二選一，不如說更像是老師和電腦並肩合作。",
