                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, computers can be very useful for language drills, maths practice, pronunciation exercises, or reviewing material at home. A student may learn the basic content through software, but then rely on the teacher to ask deeper questions, clear up misunderstandings, and connect learning to real life.",
                  "textZh": "例如，電腦在語言操練、數學練習、發音訓練，或者在家重溫課堂內容方面，都可以很有幫助。學生也許可以先透過軟件學會基本內容，但之後仍然要依靠老師去提出更深入的問題、澄清誤解，並把學習和真實生活連結起來。",
