                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that it has changed almost every part of modern life. It has transformed the way people communicate, learn, work, shop, and even think about distance. In the past, information moved at a much slower pace, and staying in touch with people far away took real effort. Now, the world feels much smaller, almost as if whole continents have been brought within arm’s reach. To me, that kind of impact is hard to beat.",
                  "textZh": "主要原因是，它幾乎改變了現代生活的每一個部分。它徹底改變了人們溝通、學習、工作、購物，甚至理解距離的方式。以前，資訊流動得慢得多，而要和遠方的人保持聯絡，也往往要花上不少力氣。現在，世界感覺小了很多，幾乎像是整個地球都被拉到伸手可及的範圍之內。對我來說，這種影響力真的很難被超越。",
