                  "textEn": "If you judge “the best” by how many lives have been protected or improved, then things like vaccines, antibiotics, or medical imaging make an incredibly strong case. The internet has changed the rhythm of life, but medical inventions have changed the odds of life itself. In other words, one has made life more connected, while the other has made life more survivable.",
