                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think international cooperation in science can have a hugely positive influence, mainly because it allows knowledge, talent, and resources to be pooled rather than kept in separate corners.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，國際科學合作可以帶來非常正面的影響，主要因為它能讓知識、人才和資源被匯聚起來，而不是分散地各自留在不同角落。",
