                  "textEn": "To me, there is a difference between making science compulsory and forcing every student down the same academic path. Basic scientific literacy is essential, but beyond that, students should have some freedom to follow their strengths and interests. A future artist, writer, or musician still needs enough science to think clearly, but they do not necessarily need to be pushed deep into complex formulas if that is not where their gifts lie. In other words, the foundation should be shared, but the staircase does not have to be identical for everyone.",
