                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, some people simply find texting inconvenient, tiring, or less satisfying than speaking directly.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，有些人也只是單純覺得打字很麻煩、很累，或者遠遠沒有直接說話那麼令人滿足。",
