                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, if someone needs to explain a complicated problem, they may feel it is much easier to call a friend than to send ten separate messages and still worry that the meaning has not landed properly. In that case, texting starts to feel less like convenience and more like hard work.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果一個人需要解釋一個很複雜的問題，他可能會覺得，與其分十條訊息慢慢傳，還不如直接打個電話給朋友，而且打完之後還不用擔心對方到底有沒有完全明白。在這種情況下，傳訊息給人的感覺就不再是方便，反而更像是一種費力。",
