                  "textEn": "I think people generally prefer texting because it is more convenient, less intrusive, and easier to fit into daily life.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，人們普遍更喜歡傳訊息，因為它比較方便、沒有那麼打擾別人，也更容易融入日常生活。",
