                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think people also prefer texting because it feels less awkward and leaves a clear record of what was said.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也覺得，人們喜歡傳訊息，還因為它比較不尷尬，而且能清楚留下說過甚麼的紀錄。",
