                  "textEn": "For instance, if friends are arranging dinner, or colleagues are confirming a time and place, texting is often easier because everyone can check the message again later. In the same way, if someone wants to say something slightly sensitive, they may feel more comfortable putting it into words first rather than being caught off guard in a call.",
