                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say advertisements usually mix truth with persuasion. They can give some correct information, but they are far more interested in getting people to buy than in helping them think twice.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說廣告通常是真實資訊和說服技巧的混合體。它們的確可以提供某些正確資料，但它們更在意的，始終是讓人掏錢，而不是讓人三思。",
