                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a classroom full of excited children, or a packed restaurant at dinner time, can be every bit as noisy as a street outside. In the same way, if a family lives in a small flat with the TV on, people talking, and children running around, peace and quiet can quickly go out of the window.",
