                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "I think one of the most effective ways to reduce traffic noise is through better urban planning and stronger control measures from the government.",
                  "textZh": "我認為，減少交通噪音其中一個最有效的方法，就是更好的城市規劃，以及政府更有力的管制措施。",
