                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea 2",
                  "textEn": "On top of that, I think people themselves can also help by changing the way they travel and by driving more considerately.",
                  "textZh": "除此之外，我也認為，人們自己其實也可以透過改變出行方式，以及更有公德心地駕駛，去幫忙減少交通噪音。",
