                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, in Hong Kong, people celebrate things like Christmas and Halloween very enthusiastically, even though they are not originally local traditions. At the same time, in many places outside Asia, people have also become more familiar with Lunar New Year customs, such as red packets, festive food, or dragon and lion dances.",
