                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example 2",
                  "textEn": "For instance, Christmas in some places may be less about religion and more about decorations, shopping, and gathering with family. Likewise, a festival borrowed from abroad may end up feeling half foreign and half local, almost like it has learned a new accent.",
                  "textZh": "例如，在某些地方，聖誕節也許已經不太著重宗教意義，反而更像是一個關於燈飾、購物，以及和家人相聚的節日。同樣地，一個從外地傳進來的節日，最後也可能會變得一半外來、一半本地，幾乎像是學會了一種新的口音。",
