                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say yes, globalisation does encourage countries to adopt each other’s traditions, but what usually happens is not simple imitation. It is more like cultural blending. Traditions travel across borders, but they rarely arrive unchanged.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，是的，全球化的確會促使各國吸收彼此的傳統，但真正發生的通常不是簡單模仿，而更像是一種文化融合。傳統會跨越國界流動，但很少會以完全不變的樣子到達另一個地方。",
