                  "number": 4,
                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say yes, it is necessary to protect traditions, but with judgment rather than blind loyalty. The best traditions deserve to be carried forward, not because they are old, but because they still have life in them.",
