                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, someone from Hong Kong who visits a country with a much slower pace of life may come back rethinking what success really means. They may start to question whether being constantly busy is truly a badge of honour, or whether a calmer, more balanced life actually makes more sense.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個來自香港的人如果去了生活節奏慢得多的國家旅行，回來之後可能就會重新思考，成功到底是甚麼意思。他可能會開始懷疑，永遠忙個不停是否真的值得被視為一種光榮，還是其實一種更平靜、更平衡的生活才更合理。",
