                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, a person who takes the time to talk to locals, try unfamiliar food, use public transport, and notice how daily life works is far more likely to come home with a changed perspective. By contrast, someone who treats the whole trip like a photo opportunity may enjoy it, but remain more or less the same inside.",
                  "textZh": "例如，一個願意花時間和當地人交談、嘗試陌生食物、搭乘公共交通，並留意當地人日常生活怎樣運作的人，回來時就更有可能帶著改變了的視角。相反，一個把整趟旅行都當成打卡拍照機會的人，也許同樣會玩得開心，但內在其實可能沒有太大變化。",
