                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation",
                  "textEn": "The main reason is that transport systems, safety standards, and access to information have all improved a great deal. Planes, trains, and cars are generally built with stronger safety features, and travellers today also have tools that people in the past simply did not have, such as mobile phones, GPS, translation apps, and instant access to emergency help. In that sense, modern travellers often carry a kind of safety net in their pocket.",
