                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone gets lost in a foreign city today, they can usually check a map on their phone, message someone, book a ride, or even translate what they want to say within seconds. In the past, the same situation could have been far more stressful and much harder to deal with.",
                  "textZh": "例如，如果今天有人在外國城市迷路了，他通常可以立刻用手機看地圖、傳訊息給別人、叫車，甚至在幾秒內翻譯自己想說的話。放在過去，同樣的情況往往會令人壓力大得多，也更難處理。",
