                  "stage": "explanation",
                  "labelEn": "Explanation",
                  "labelZh": "解釋",
                  "sourceLabel": "Explanation 2",
                  "textEn": "For one thing, crowded transport hubs, online scams, cyber fraud, and fast-moving misinformation can create problems that travellers in the past did not face in quite the same way. On top of that, because travel is easier and more common now, people sometimes become too relaxed and let their guard down. In other words, travel may be safer on paper, but common sense still matters just as much as ever.",
                  "textZh": "首先，擠迫的交通樞紐、網上詐騙、電子騙案，以及傳播得很快的錯誤資訊，都可能製造一些過去旅客未必以同樣方式遇到的問題。除此之外，正因為現在旅行更容易、也更普遍，人有時反而會太放鬆，因而鬆懈警覺。換句話說，旅行在整體上也許更安全了，但常識的重要性其實和以前一樣，甚至一點也沒有減少。",
