                  "sourceNumber": 8,
                  "stage": "conclusion",
                  "labelEn": "Conclusion",
                  "labelZh": "總結",
                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say it is safer to travel today than in the past, but only in the sense that the tools and systems are better. In the end, safer travel does not just come from modern technology; it also comes from staying alert, using good judgment, and not mistaking convenience for invincibility.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說現在旅行的確比過去更安全，但這主要是因為工具和制度都進步了。說到底，更安全的旅行不只是來自現代科技，也來自保持警覺、運用判斷力，以及不要把方便誤以為無懈可擊。",
