                  "stage": "idea",
                  "labelEn": "Idea",
                  "labelZh": "主旨",
                  "sourceLabel": "Idea",
                  "textEn": "In Hong Kong, I’d say one of the clearest positive impacts of tourism is that it brings money into the economy and supports a wide range of jobs.",
                  "textZh": "在香港，我會說，旅遊業其中一個最明顯的正面影響，就是它會把資金帶進經濟裡，並支撐很多不同類型的工作。",
