                  "sourceNumber": 3,
                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, when visitors come to Hong Kong, they may stay in hotels, eat at local cafés, buy souvenirs, take taxis, and visit places like museums or theme parks. A single tourist may seem like just one person, but their spending can ripple outward and support many different parts of the city at once.",
                  "textZh": "例如，當旅客來到香港時，他們可能會住酒店、在本地咖啡店吃東西、買手信、坐的士，或者去博物館和主題樂園等地方。一位旅客看起來也許只是一個人，但他的消費其實會像漣漪一樣向外擴散，同時支撐起城市裡很多不同的部分。",
