                  "stage": "example",
                  "labelEn": "Example",
                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For instance, when tourists show interest in Cantonese food, festivals, markets, or historic neighbourhoods, local people may start valuing those things even more themselves. Sometimes it takes an outsider’s eyes to remind a place of its own charm.",
                  "textZh": "例如，當旅客對廣東菜、節日、市集，或者一些有歷史感的社區表現出興趣時，本地人反而也可能會更重新珍惜這些東西。有時候，一個地方的魅力，真的需要透過外來者的眼睛，才會被自己人再次看清。",
