                  "sourceLabel": "Conclusion 2",
                  "textEn": "Overall, I’d say the positive impacts of tourism in Hong Kong are economic, social, and cultural. It brings income, supports jobs, and adds life to the city, but it also helps people and places connect. At its best, tourism does not just fill hotel rooms; it breathes fresh life into the city itself.",
                  "textZh": "總結來說，我會說，旅遊業在香港帶來的正面影響是經濟上的、社會上的，也是文化上的。它帶來收入、支撐就業，並為城市注入活力，但它同時也幫助人與地方建立連結。當旅遊業運作得好的時候，它不只是填滿酒店房間，而是真正替整座城市注入新的生命力。",
