                  "labelZh": "例子",
                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, if someone is choosing a restaurant, a hotel, or even a product online, they are far more likely to click on something with strong ratings than something with poor or unclear feedback. Even if they do not fully trust strangers, the overall score still shapes their first impression.",
