                  "sourceLabel": "Example",
                  "textEn": "For example, people may still come for the skyline, shopping, or famous food, but what may really stay with them is the fuller experience: taking the Star Ferry, exploring older neighbourhoods, hiking with a sea view, visiting local festivals, or just feeling that East-meets-West mix that gives Hong Kong its own flavour.",
